International Paper,,,,Linkup,International Paper Continues Strategic Transformation with North America Packaging Network Optimization,PR Newswire,2026-06-26T00:00:00Z,2026-06-26 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/international-paper-continues-strategic-transformation-with-north-america-packaging-network-optimization-302812285.html,"International Paper announced plans to close four North America packaging plants in Richwood, KY; Aurora, IL; Elk Grove, CA; and Barrington, NJ by the end of Q3 2026 to optimize its network and focus on higher-value opportunities. The company aims to strengthen its cost position and increase capacity while serving customers through other regional facilities."
