International Paper,,,,Syracuse,International Paper Declares Quarterly Dividend,PR Newswire,2026-07-14T20:05:00Z,2026-07-14 20:05:00+00:00,EquityActionsActivity,https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/international-paper-declares-quarterly-dividend-302825464.html,"MEMPHIS, Tenn., July 14, 2026 /PRNewswire/ - International Paper (NYSE: IP; LSE: IPC) , today declared a quarterly dividend of $ 0.4625 per share for the period from July 1, 2026, to September 30, 2026, inclusive, on the common stock, par value $ 1.00, of the Company, payable on September 15, 2026, to holders of record at the close of business on August 14, 2026. Today, the Company also declared a quarterly dividend of $ 1.00 per share for the period from July 1, 2026, to September 30, 2026, inclusive, on the cumulative $ 4.00 preferred stock of the Company, payable on September 15, 2026, to holders of record at the close of business on August 14, 2026. About International Paper (NYSE: IP; LSE: IPC) International Paper creates sustainable packaging solutions that enable our customers, teammates and shareowners to thrive in an ever-changing world. We are a leader in corrugated packaging, partnering with customers across industries to protect what matters most, strengthen supply chains and create lasting value."
