Jiangin Yonghe Packaging Products,,,,Perplexity,Fluorochemical sector sees realized market prosperity; Yonghe expects Q2 net profit above RMB 280 million,Futu News,2026-07-03T00:00:00Z,2026-07-03 00:00:00+00:00,,https://news.futunn.com/en/ja/post/75465385/fluorochemical-sector-sees-realized-market-prosperity-yonghe-shares-expects-q2,"The article reports that Yonghe forecast first-half 2026 attributable net profit of RMB 460 million to RMB 550 million, implying a strong Q2 and a new single-quarter profit record since listing. It attributes the growth mainly to the fluorinated polymer materials business, with core refrigerant product prices remaining elevated."
Jiangin Yonghe Packaging Products,,,,Perplexity,"Yonghe Co., Ltd.: refrigerant market conditions continue to improve, while fluoropolymer profitability turns upward",Futu News,2026-07-03T00:00:00Z,2026-07-03 00:00:00+00:00,,https://news.futunn.com/en/post/75540570/yonghe-co-ltd-605020-refrigerant-market-sentiment-continues-to-strengthen,"The company said its 2026 H1 net profit is expected to rise 70% to 103% year over year, with growth driven by refrigerant profitability, higher volumes and prices for fluoropolymer materials, and improved output quality at the Shaowu base. The report also highlights growth in higher-end cable-grade FEP and other premium fluoropolymers, which is relevant to product-mix and supplier risk assessments."
