Husky Technologies,,,,Syracuse,Husky Launches HyCap 4.0 Tooling for Beverage Closure Manufacturing,plasticstoday,2026-05-29T15:35:27Z,2026-05-29 15:35:27+00:00,ProductActivity,https://www.plasticstoday.com/packaging/husky-technologies-launches-hycap-40-tooling-platform-for-beverage-closure-manufacturing-efficiency,"Husky Technologies is targeting beverage closure manufacturers with its newly launched HyCap 4.0 tooling platform, an injection molding solution engineered to meet rising demands for lightweight, sustainable packaging while navigating increasingly complex regulatory requirements. The timing addresses critical industry pressures. Beverage packaging producers face mounting challenges from tethered cap mandates in the European Union, accelerating lightweighting trends, and the need for faster production cycles with lower operating costs. For plastics processors, the company said this platform represents an advancement in precision tooling designed specifically for high-volume closure production environments. The system supports accurate molding of increasingly complex closure designs."
