Jindal Films,,,,Perplexity,"SC overturns two rulings in Jindal Poly Films case, appoints sole arbitrator",Sahi,2026-06-09T00:00:00Z,2026-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.sahi.com/news/sc-overturns-2-rulings-in-jindal-poly-films-case-appointing-1-sole-arbitrator-for-faster-resolution-1618-PE1_COR,"The Supreme Court quashed two tribunal rulings tied to Jindal Poly Films and referred the dispute to a court-appointed sole arbitrator. This reduces near-term legal uncertainty, but it also signals continuing litigation risk that could affect governance, counterparty negotiations, and financing discussions."
