Klockner Pentaplast,,,,Syracuse,Recyclable fruit tray range launched for fresh produce,FreshPlaza.com,2026-07-02T13:33:00Z,2026-07-02 13:33:00+00:00,ProductActivity,https://www.freshplaza.com/north-america/article/9853124/recyclable-fruit-tray-range-launched-for-fresh-produce/,"Klöckner Pentaplast (kp) , a manufacturer of rigid and flexible packaging and specialty film solutions, has expanded its kp Infinity® portfolio with the launch of a new fruit tray range designed for packed fresh fruit. Building on the use of kp Infinity in food-to-go packaging, the new range introduces tray formats for fresh fruit, bringing mono-material packaging to the fresh produce market. As retailers, producers, and consumers place greater emphasis on packaging sustainability, fresh produce businesses are looking for solutions that help reduce food waste and improve recyclability while maintaining product presentation. The new kp Infinity Fruit Tray Range has been developed to address these requirements. © Klöckner Pentaplast."
