Universal McCann,,,,Perplexity,"Universal Corporation annual report for fiscal year ending March 31, 2026",MarketScreener,2026-05-28T00:00:00Z,2026-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.marketscreener.com/news/universal-annual-report-for-fiscal-year-ending-march-31-2026-form-10-k-ce7f5dd9dd81f22f,"Universal Corporation’s 2026 annual report says liquidity was sufficient to meet needs, capital projects totaled $53.5 million, and $81.3 million was returned to shareholders through dividends. It also notes higher working-capital requirements than in fiscal 2025, which is useful when assessing cash-flow resilience and supplier payment capacity.[7]"
