Universal McCann,,,,Tavily,"MSP Acquisitions Surge, Leadership Integration Crucial for Value Creation | Blake Wetzel posted on the topic | LinkedIn",,,,,https://www.linkedin.com/posts/blwetzel_privateequity-valuecreation-mergersandacquisitions-activity-7490460115079405568-K5oX,"The global figures reinforce this trend. First-half M&A reached a record $2.8 trillion, up 48% year on year, even as the number of announced transactions fell 9% to a six-year low. Forty-seven deals worth more than $10 billion contributed over $1.3 trillion—nearly half of the total market. Activity is concentrating in areas where companies see an urgent strategic need for scale: -Technology and AI: semiconductors, cybersecurity, computing and data-centre infrastructure -Energy and utilities: power generation, grids and assets positioned to serve rising data-centre demand -Life sciences: pipeline expansion, specialist therapies and access to innovation -Real estate: large REIT combinations seeking scale and operating efficiencies [...] M&A surges in 2026—but megadeals are masking a divided market U.S. mergers and acquisitions have entered a new phase of activity. During the first five months of 2026, announced U.S. M&A value reached approximately $1.2 trillion, compared with $603 billio"
