Commerzbank AG,,,,Perplexity,Acceptance period for UniCredit’s offer concluded – Commerzbank remains focused on creating value for all stakeholders,Commerzbank AG / EQS-News,2026-07-08T10:56:00+02:00,2026-07-08 10:56:00+02:00,,https://www.eqs-news.com/news/corporate/acceptance-period-for-unicredits-offer-concluded-commerzbank-remains-focused-on-creating-value-for-all-stakeholders/e8dfc9b6-a869-4c17-a914-0fdbb7bef99c_en,"Commerzbank said the acceptance period for UniCredit's offer had ended, with 17.60% of shares tendered in the additional acceptance period and regulatory approvals still required for any transfer. This is important for supplier-risk monitoring because ownership change, approvals and strategic uncertainty can alter counterparty behavior, decision speed and long-term sourcing priorities."
