Commerzbank AG,,,,Syracuse,Commerzbank (CBK) Says Teaming Up With UniCredit (UCG) Could Create Value,Bloomberg,2026-08-06T09:45:37.016000Z,2026-08-06 09:45:37.016000+00:00,OperationsActivity,https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-06/commerzbank-says-teaming-up-with-unicredit-could-create-value,"Commerzbank AG Chief Executive Officer Bettina Orlopp struck a more positive tone on UniCredit SpA as she prepares for talks that will determine her lender's future. "" It's our job jointly together with Unicredit to figure out how we can create value ,"" Orlopp said Thursday on Bloomberg TV. The comments underscore how the German lender's leaders have effectively given up the fight against the prospect of Orcel taking control, and instead now focus on finding common ground with him. They also set the stage for what could be months of discussions about the changes that Commerzbank will face once UniCredit obtains the shares tendered to it in an acquisition offer, ultimately giving it control of almost 50 % in the rival. Orlopp also confirmed a previous Bloomberg News report that she and UniCredit CEO Andrea Orcel will soon meet to discuss the matter."
