Linklaters,,,,Linkup,Linklaters profits climb as firm points to US investment paying off,Nonbillable,2026-07-21T08:50:00Z,2026-07-21 08:50:00+00:00,,https://www.nonbillable.co.uk/news/linklaters-financial-results-2026,"Linklaters reported record financial results for FY26, with revenue rising 7% to £2.47 billion and profit per equity partner increasing 11% to £2.48 million. The firm highlighted its successful US investment, doubling US revenue and quadrupling US profit over four years, with a 39% profit rise in the latest year."
