Bloomberg,,,,Perplexity,How national security risk is changing compliance screening,Bloomberg Professional Services,2026-08-01T00:00:00Z,2026-08-01 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.bloomberg.com/professional/insights/regulation/how-national-security-risk-is-changing-compliance-screening/,"Bloomberg Professional Services discusses how national-security concerns are reshaping compliance screening, with greater attention to counterparties, ownership structures, and cross-border risk. This is relevant for procurement and supplier management because it suggests tighter due-diligence expectations and more scrutiny of suppliers operating in sensitive sectors or jurisdictions."
