ALPEK POLYESTER,,,,Perplexity,"Alpek Q2 2026 slides: EBITDA surges 300%, guidance raised sharply",Investing.com,2026-07-23T00:00:00Z,2026-07-23 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/alpek-q2-2026-slides-ebitda-surges-300-guidance-raised-sharply-93CH-4809681,"Alpek reported second-quarter 2026 results showing reported EBITDA up 300% year over year to $407 million and comparable EBITDA up 169% to $336 million, driven by stronger margins, higher volumes, and operational execution. The company also raised full-year 2026 comparable EBITDA guidance to $750–800 million and operating free cash flow guidance to $300–350 million, while indicating deleveraging and investment priorities over dividend resumption."
