CONSTELLIUM,,,,Linkup,Constellium Q2 2026 slides: record EBITDA across all segments,Investing.com,2026-07-29T00:00:00Z,2026-07-29 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/constellium-q2-2026-slides-record-ebitda-across-all-segments-93CH-4821030,"Constellium presented record Q2 2026 earnings with broad-based strength across its portfolio, including aerospace benefiting from improved demand and strong OEM backlogs. The company raised its full-year adjusted EBITDA guidance to $980 million to $1.020 billion and maintained free cash flow guidance above $300 million, while repurchasing shares and reducing debt."
