CONSTELLIUM,,,,Perplexity,Constellium Partners with EOS to Accelerate Industrial Adoption of Aluminum Additive Manufacturing,MarketScreener / Globe Newswire,2026-07-21T00:00:00Z,2026-07-21 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.marketscreener.com/news/constellium-partners-with-eos-to-accelerate-industrial-adoption-of-aluminum-additive-manufacturing-ce7f5edbd188f620,"Constellium announced a strategic partnership with EOS to accelerate industrial adoption of aluminum additive manufacturing, including rebranding Constellium's Aheadd CP1 as EOS Aluminium Constellium CP1 and collaboration on Al5X1 industrialization. This matters for product innovation and supplier strategy because it points to new material qualification pathways, broader application potential, and potential competitive differentiation in advanced alloys."
