SNOWFLAKE,,,,Syracuse,Snowflake Offers Agencies Discounts for Data Tools Under OneGov Agreement With GSA,Executive Gov,2026-05-22T20:42:38Z,2026-05-22 20:42:38+00:00,PartnershipActivity,https://www.executivegov.com/articles/gsa-snowflake-onegov-ai-data,"Snowflake Offers Agencies Discounts for Data Tools Under OneGov Agreement With GSA. Snowflake is offering agencies discounts for its computer and storage services under a OneGov agreement with GSA. GSA Administrator Edward Forst said the agreement will break down data silos to accelerate the adoption of AI tools tailored for each agency's mission. Senior government leaders will discuss AI use cases in federal civilian agencies at the 2026 FedCiv Summit on Oct. 29. The General Services Administration has entered into a OneGov agreement with Snowflake, an artificial intelligence data cloud company, to accelerate federal adoption of AI and support government modernization."
