a's Haier has seen a surge in orders from Europe. The company has adjusted its production plans for the European market, stepping up the manufacturing of air conditioner orders to meet international market demand. (Xinhua/Li Ziheng) ... As unprecedented heatwaves scor ... this summer, demand for affordable and energy-efficient air ... is rising. ... As a globally renowned home appliance manufacturer, China's Haier has seen a surge in orders from Europe. The company has adjusted its production plans for the European market, stepping up the manufacturing of air conditioner orders to meet international market demand. (Xinhua/Li Ziheng) ... 6. As ... scorch Europe this summer, demand for ... and energy-efficient air conditioners is rising. ... As a globally renowned home appliance manufacturer, China's Haier has seen a surge in orders from Europe. The company has adjusted its production plans for the European market, stepping up the manufacturing of air conditioner orders to meet international market demand. (Xinhua/Li Ziheng) ... factory in Jia ... 26. As unprecedented heatwaves ... ch Europe this summer, demand for affordable and energy-efficient air conditioners is rising. ... As a globally renowned home appliance manufacturer, China's Haier has seen a surge in orders from Europe. The company has adjusted its production plans for the European market, stepping up the manufacturing of air conditioner orders to meet international market demand. (Xinhua/Li Ziheng) ... China's Haier steps up manufacturing air conditioners to meet Europe's rising demand"
HAIER,,,,Exa,海尔智家深度全球化又落一子，新西兰新园区建成 - 海尔集团官网,www.haier.com,2026-08-03T00:00:00.000Z,2026-08-03 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/press-events/news/20260803_293760.shtml,海尔智家深度全球化又落一子，新西兰新园区建成 - 海尔集团官网 海尔智家深度全球化又落一子，新西兰新园区建成 2026.08.03 近日，海尔智家旗下斐雪派克创新园区在新西兰正式建成。该园区将于今年10月份投入使用。园区承担着斐雪派克全球总部、海尔智家澳新区域总部“双总部”职能。 对于斐雪派克而言，新园区将实现研发能力的跃升，全面提升在前沿研发、工业设计、工程、产品智能化、家电测试、可再生能源及智慧家庭解决方案等领域的综合实力。对于海尔智家而言，新园区是其在全球落地智慧家庭战略的重要支点，也是其深度全球化布局的重要载体，将加速研发、制造、物流等十大能力在澳新市场的本土化落地，双向赋能澳新市场和全球市场发展。 ... 值得一提的是，新园区的建设与运营全程贯彻可持续发展理念。办公楼主体重型木结构实现建造阶段的“碳盈余”，全域铺设的太阳能光伏板，年发电量完全覆盖办公楼全年用电，既落地品牌低碳发展主张，也充分展现其在光伏发电、互联能源系统领域的技术实力。 凭借优质的产品与系统方案，海尔、斐雪派克持续夯实双品牌澳新TOP1地位。新园区启用后，将赋能斐雪派克家庭解决方案与斐雪派克零碳智能家居研发研究所，推动斐雪派克技术边界从单一家电产品，延伸至智能家电生态、互联科技、能源管理与清洁能源解决方案领域，更好地满足全球市场绿色、智能居住需求。
HAIER,,,,Exa,"Haier's AI Eye Washing Machine Debuts at Canton Fair, Targets European Market - xix.ai",xix.ai,2026-08-02T00:00:00.000Z,2026-08-02 00:00:00+00:00,,https://xix.ai/ainews/haiers-ai-eye-washing-machine-debuts-at-canton-fair-targets-european-market.html,"Haier's AI Eye Washing Machine Debuts at Canton Fair, Targets European Market - xix.ai ... # Haier's AI Eye Washing Machine Debuts at Canton Fair, Targets European Market ... At the 139th Canton Fair, Haier unveiled a standout product that drew significant attention: the V12 washing machine. ... Its most distinctive feature is the industry-first ""AI Eye."" While it may sound like a marketing trick, the real-world benefits are substantial. Before washing, it detects clothing colors to prevent color bleeding. During the cycle, it monitors foam levels in real time and adjusts the number of rinses accordingly. After washing, if clothes remain inside for too long, it sends a reminder. From start to finish, the machine actively manages the wash process rather than simply running through a preset program. ... Beyond the AI Eye, the V12 incorporates Wind Cruise Pro and Essence Wash technology. These features were reportedly developed specifically to align with the laundry habits and care preferences of European users. ... This machine has a clear target: it is scheduled to officially enter the European market later this year. The timing is strategic. Haier’s washing machines already lead Chinese brands in both sales volume and revenue within the European export market, and they are the only Chinese washing machine brand to earn the highest German Stiwa certification. Launching a flagship model on the back of an established reputation and market leadership is a calculated move to strengthen its strongest segment. ... The export of Chinese home appliances has moved beyond price competition. Today, success hinges on technological innovation and brand recognition. Haier’s washing machine with “eyes” perfectly illustrates this shift."
HAIER,,,,Exa,"EQS-CMS: Haier Smart Home Co., Ltd.: Release according to Article 50 of the WpHG [the German Securities Trading Act] with the objective of Europe-wide distribution",www.finanznachrichten.de,2026-07-31T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-31 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.finanznachrichten.de/nachrichten-2026-07/69186728-eqs-cms-haier-smart-home-co-ltd-release-according-to-article-50-of-the-wphg-the-german-securities-trading-act-with-the-objective-of-europe-wide-023.htm,"EQS-CMS: Haier Smart Home Co., Ltd.: Release according to Article 50 of the WpHG [the German Securities Trading Act] with the objective of Europe-wide distribution ... # EQS-CMS: Haier Smart Home Co., Ltd.: Release according to Article 50 of the WpHG [the German Securities Trading Act] with the objective of Europe-wide distribution ... EQS Post-admission Duties announcement: Haier Smart Home Co.,Ltd. / Third country release according to Article 50 Para. 1, No. 2 of the WpHG [the German Securities Trading Act] Haier Smart Home Co.,Ltd.: Release according to Article 50 of the WpHG [the German Securities Trading Act] with the objective of Europe-wide distribution 31.07.2026 / 17:36 CET/CEST Dissemination of a Post-admission Duties announcement according to Article 50 Para. 1, No. 2 WpHG transmitted by EQS News - a service of EQS Group. The issuer is solely responsible for the content of this announcement. Announcement on Providing Guarantees for Holding Subsidiaries ... Qingdao / Shanghai / Frankfurt / Hong Kong, 31 July 2026 - Haier Smart Home Co., Ltd. (the ""Company"" or ""Haier Smart Home"", D-share 690D.DE, A-share 600690.SH, H-share 06690.HK) today published an announcement in accordance with applicable trading rules of the Shanghai Stock Exchange and applicable PRC laws in relation to Providing Guarantees for Holding Subsidiaries. ... Haier Smart Home is the world's largest home appliance company and a global leader in smart home solutions. Its portfolio spans refrigerators, washing machines, air conditioners, kitchen appliances and water heaters, complemented by HVAC, smart building and water solutions, all integrated through its smart home platform. ... Operating localised R&D, manufacturing and commercial capabilities in more than 30 countries, the Company's portfolio of brands - Haier, Casarte, Leader, GE Appliances, Candy, Fisher & Paykel and AQUA - serves consumers across the full price spectrum in over 160 countries and regions. This 'global enablement, local execution' model underpins the Company's competitive position in every market it serves. ... The Company is committed to evolving from a global appliance leader into a user-centric, platform-based smart home ecosystem company, with premium positioning, global reach, digital capabilities and AI-driven product innovation as its core strategic pillars."
