n smart home solutions. Its portfolio spans refrigerators, washing machines, air conditioners, kitchen appliances and water heaters, complemented by HVAC, smart building and water solutions, all integrated through its smart home platform. ... Operating localised R&D, manufacturing and commercial capabilities in more than 30 countries, the Company’s portfolio of brands — Haier, Casarte, Leader, GE Appliances, Candy, Fisher & Paykel and AQUA — serves consumers across the full price spectrum in over 160 countries and regions. This ‘global enablement, local execution’ model underpins the Company’s competitive position in every market it serves. ... The Company is committed to evolving from a global appliance leader into a user-centric, platform-based smart home ecosystem company, with premium positioning, global reach, digital capabilities and AI-driven product innovation as its core strategic pillars. 31.07.2026 CET/CEST The EQS Distribution Services include Regulatory Announcements, Financial/Corporate News and Press Releases. View original content: EQS News"
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Smart Home Climbs 12 Spots to No. 378 on the 2026 Fortune Global 500-Haier Malaysia,www.haier.com,2026-07-30T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-30 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/my/about-haier/news/20260730_293640.shtml,"Haier Smart Home Climbs 12 Spots to No. 378 on the 2026 Fortune Global 500-Haier Malaysia ... Haier Smart Home Climbs 12 Spots to No. 378 on the 2026 Fortune Global 500 ... Haier Smart Home Climbs 12 Spots to No. 378 on the 2026 Fortune Global 500 ... 07- ... Haier Smart Home Climbs 12 Spots to No. 378 on the 2026 Fortune Global 500 ... Ninth consecutive year on the list, reflecting the compounding effect of global brand leadership and enterprise-wide AI integration. ... On July 28, the 2026 Fortune Global 500 was released, with Haier Smart Home climbing 12 positions to No. 378 — its ninth consecutive year on the list and its most decisive single-year advance to date. ... The result reflects two forces that have been building in parallel: a global brand and operations footprint that has matured into genuine local leadership in every major market, and an AI integration effort that is restructuring how the organization itself works. ... Haier Smart Home's brand portfolio, including Haier, Casarte, Leader, GE Appliances, Fisher & Paykel, AQUA, and Candy, operates as market leaders with their own manufacturing bases, R&D mandates, and product roadmaps tailored to local users. In North America, GE Appliances has held the No. 1 position among U.S. appliance companies for four consecutive years, with enlarging market share. In Europe, the company organizes by country rather than region, prioritizing speed of local response over scale efficiency. The X11 washing machine — engineered across Nuremberg, Milan, and China — consumes 70% less energy than Europe's highest A-class standard and has sold over one million units across 20-plus countries. In Southeast Asia, where Haier now ranks No. 1, a new air conditioning production base also deepens local manufacturing capabilities. ... Internally, Haier Smart Home has embedded AI across every function through a self-developed domain-specific large model and a unified technology platform. The internal entry point, ZhiXiaoNeng, is an AI digital worker serving more than 60,000 users that independently executes complete processes. ... In manufacturing engineering, ZhiXiaoNeng drafts process plans from historical data, compressing an hours-long task into minutes with a 20% improvement in accuracy. The engineer's role shifts from drafter to reviewer — a redefinition of the work itself. Across the organization, new product development cycles have shortened by 30%, manufacturing efficiency is up 20%, and the SG&A expense ratio has declined for five consecutive years. ... The smart home business sits where these two forces meet. Centered on an AI Agent, Haier Smart Home delivers AI products that anticipate user needs, AI scenarios that coordinate devices into coherent experiences, and AI lifestyles that extend intelligence into a unified person-vehicle-home-community continuum. ... The scale is no longer experimental: 130 million global registered users, 86.1 billion annual scenario interactions, and certification from Euromonitor International as the world's No. 1 enterprise by smart home sales — a shift from No. 1 in major appliances to No. 1 in smart homes. ... Taken together, the Fortune Global 500 climb is not a single-year event. It is the measurable outcome of a company that has been building local leadership in every market it serves and embedding AI across every function it runs — and the two are now reinforcing each other in ways that are difficult for competitors to replicate."
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Launches Smart 418 & 458 Refrigerators | Flare,flare.pk (ASad Flare),2026-07-28T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-28 00:00:00+00:00,,https://flare.pk/2026/07/haier-launches-smart-418-458-refrigerators/,"Haier Launches Smart 418 & 458 Refrigerators | Flare ... # Haier Launches Smart 418 & 458 Refrigerators ... July 28, 2026 ... Haier has introduced its new 418 and 458 refrigerator series, offering a combination of stylish design, smart technology, and improved food storage. The company says these refrigerators are built for modern homes and are designed to make daily life easier while keeping food fresh for a longer time. ... The new models continue Haier’s popular Magic Cooling technology and come with several new features, including 10% more storage space, IoT smart controls, advanced hygiene technology, and better energy efficiency. ... The new Haier 418 and 458 Refrigerator Series brings together modern design, smart technology, and advanced cooling features in one appliance. With 10% more storage, Magic Cooling, IoT smartphone controls, A.SPE sterilization, Humidity Control System, digital temperature sensors, and food management features, these refrigerators are designed to keep food fresh for longer while making everyday life more convenient. ... For users looking to upgrade their kitchen with a stylish, energy-efficient, and feature-rich refrigerator, Haier’s latest 418 and 458 models offer a complete smart home solution."
HAIER,,,,Exa,"Haier Saudi Arabia & BK Bukhamseen Host New Product Launch Event, Full Range of Smart Home Appliances Unveiled-Haier Saudi Arabia",www.haier.com,2026-07-27T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-27 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/sa/about-haier/news/20260727_293571.shtml,"Haier Saudi Arabia & BK Bukhamseen Host New Product Launch Event, Full Range of Smart Home Appliances Unveiled-Haier Saudi Arabia ... # Haier Saudi Arabia & BK Bukhamseen Host New Product Launch Event, Full Range of Smart Home Appliances Unveiled 07-21 2026 Release Date: 21 July 2026 ... From 19:00 to 21:30 on 20 July, Haier Saudi Arabia, together with core channel partner BK Bukhamseen, held an exclusive new product launch & experience event at BK-Al-Fardois retail store. The event gathered selected local loyal customers, BK’s management, purchasing & marketing teams, as well as Haier’s marketing and product teams, creating an immersive tasting session for Haier’s full lineup of smart home appliances. ... The event followed a complete agenda: opening remarks, strategic sharing by channel and brand representatives, word-of-mouth sharing from long-term customers, unveiling ceremonies for flagship products covering air conditioning, laundry, refrigeration and TV categories with live technical demonstrations, and a free product consultation & trial session, fully showcasing Haier’s comprehensive smart home appliance solutions customized for Saudi Arabia’s high-temperature climate and local household demands. ... Four flagship product lines of the year were officially debuted at the event. Visual experiments and real-life operations were conducted to demonstrate the core differentiated advantages of each product to all guests on site: ... 2. Unveiled jointly by Haier Product Director and BK Store Manager. The team introduced the 5-year full-unit warranty service in detail, and demonstrated the unit’s self-cleaning function and Haismart mobile remote pre-cooling feature, highlighting its strengths of health, intelligence and full adaptability to Saudi Arabia’s extreme high temperature. ... motor; a panda plush toy illustrated the ultra ... the intelligent variable-speed ... 7. Both refrigerator models were unveiled simultaneously. The Horizon851’s built-in large screen played live sports matches, paired with an iodine fresh-keeping contrast experiment; the Mailang 606 showcased HCS humidity-locking fresh-keeping film, side built-in design and innovative bottom heat dissipation structure. As Saudi Arabia’s first built-in refrigerator with long-lasting fresh-keeping performance, it attracted extensive attention from all guests. ... TV Product Manager. Gaming equipment was connected to reproduce tournament game footage, ... visual entertainment experience ... Ammar, Category & Purchasing Director of BK Bukhamseen, delivered a speech on site. He expressed gratitude to all attending customers and Haier for long-term support, and stated that both parties will further deepen cooperation, continuously launch premium home appliances and launch diversified in-store experience activities for local consumers in Hasan District. ... Ali, East Regional Sales Manager of Haier, delivered a speech in Arabic on behalf of the brand. He thanked channel partners and local consumers for long-term trust, and conveyed Haier’s brand concept that Haier is the top choice for family home appliances. Loyal long-term customers were invited to share authentic long-term usage experience of Haier appliances, voluntarily praising Haier’s reliable product quality and intelligent design. ... All guests actively participated in trials of all product categories, and took the initiative to consult about product functions, installation and after-sales service. The on-site atmosphere was highly interactive, fully reflecting local consumers’ recognition and purchase intention for Haier’s new flagship appliance series. ... This new product tasting event at BK store marks a key landing activity for Haier Saudi Arabia to deepen strategic cooperation with BK Bukhamseen. Through offline immersive scenario demonstrations, Haier fully demonstrated its strong technical R&D strength customized for Saudi Arabia’s local climate, home layout and household usage habits. Meanwhile, it further consolidated the layout of Haier’s high-end product matrix in local retail stores. ... Moving forward, Haier Saudi Arabia will continue to cooperate with all BK retail stores, regularly launch new product experience sessions, customer tasting events and offline interactive activities, continuously expand brand influence in the local market, raise brand market share, and work hand in hand with channel partners to further explore and develop Saudi Arabia’s home appliance market. ... At the closing of the event, the Haier team and all BK channel guests took a group photo together, recording the shared vision of joint development and striving for leading market position through mutual cooperation."
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Saudi Arabia Holds High-Level Strategic Meeting with eXtra to Explore Saudi Home Appliance Market-Haier Saudi Arabia,www.haier.com,2026-07-27T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-27 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/sa/about-haier/news/20260727_293573.shtml,"Haier Saudi Arabia Holds High-Level Strategic Meeting with eXtra to Explore Saudi Home Appliance Market-Haier Saudi Arabia ... # Haier Saudi Arabia Holds High-Level Strategic Meeting with eXtra to Explore Saudi Home Appliance Market 07-22 2026 - Group photo of senior executives from both parties - Haier product specialist introduces fresh-keeping refrigerator series to eXtra team - On-site technical demonstration & introduction of air conditioner products - Function introduction of all-in-one washer & dryer - Scene shots of interactive experience zone for Haier smart TV - On-site photos of forum discussion and product tasting session ... On 22 July, Haier Saudi Arabia held a high-level strategic meeting with eXtra, the top-tier home appliance retail channel partner across Saudi Arabia. Mr. Najib, Group Categories Manager, and Mr. Chebier, Washing Goods Category Manager, led the core eXtra team to visit Haier brand showroom. ... Both sides conducted in-depth business negotiations focusing on three key directions: long-term business growth, coordination of market resources, and upgrading of strategic cooperation. ... During the meeting, the Haier Saudi team accompanied the eXtra team to visit the full lineup of premium new products customized for local Saudi demand. Core technical strengths of refrigeration, laundry, smart display and other product lines were demonstrated on site, fully presenting localized home appliance solutions tailored to Saudi Arabia's high-temperature climate and household consumption habits. ... The senior management team of eXtra fully recognized Haier's global leading brand strength and comprehensive product competitiveness. The team expressed strong intention to introduce the complete portfolio of newly-launched products, and the two sides reached preliminary consensus on new product listing, joint marketing campaigns and channel resource support. ... As the leading retail channel in Saudi Arabia, eXtra owns nationwide offline stores and complete online e-commerce channel resources with huge customer traffic. ... After this high-level meeting, Haier Saudi Arabia formally invited the core eXtra team to attend the IFA Global Home Appliance Exhibition in Germany and France. This top-tier industry exhibition will serve as a key opportunity to further deepen the strategic partnership between the two brands. ... Moving forward, both parties will seize market cooperation opportunities to unlock new growth momentum in Saudi home appliance market, steadily raise Haier's overall market share in Saudi Arabia, and continuously consolidate Haier's leading position across the Middle East market."
HAIER,,,,Exa,海尔连续10年稳居中国全球化品牌十强 - 海尔集团官网,www.haier.com,2026-07-27T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-27 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/active/brandz2026/news/20260727_293560.shtml,首页 BrandZ2026新闻报道海尔连续10年稳居中国全球化品牌十强 ... 海尔连续10年稳居中国全球化品牌十强 ... 2026.07.25 ... 来源： 人 ... 7月24日，凯度BrandZ正式发布《2026年中国全球化品牌50强》榜单及分析报告，海尔位列榜单第六位，蝉联家电行业第一，连续10年稳居中国全球化品牌十强，品牌力再攀新高。 ... 作为衡量中国品牌全球竞争力的重要研究之一，《凯度BrandZ中国全球化品牌50强》已连续发布十年，本年度研究选取了澳⼤利亚、巴西、法国、德国、印度、印度尼西亚、日本、墨西哥、西班牙、美国和英国等11个不同地理区域的市场，覆盖家电、消费电子、汽车等15大核心品类，结合凯度BrandZ品牌力模型MDS研究框架与海外平台大数据分析，以权威视角追踪中国品牌全球化进程，洞察中国品牌走向全球的新趋势与新机遇。 ... 当前中国品牌正加速从“产品出海”到“品牌全球化”的关键跃迁，今年上榜的50家企业多为营收规模达千亿级的行业龙头，企业的盈利能力强劲，其中上市公司占比高达60%。凯度集团全球首席执行官Paul Zwillenberg表示，当前中国全球化品牌正以全新的商业模式、消费者资产运营体系与品牌价值叙事，重塑市场格局，成为全球增长的新引擎。 ... 作为全球创牌的引领者，海尔已经连续10年稳居十强，以本土化服务支撑全球化战略，构建了研发、制造、营销三位一体的本土化体系，既保持了全球品牌认知的一致性，又深度融入不同区域市场，展现出强劲的品牌韧性与增长潜力。 ... 在品牌布局上，海尔始终坚持自主创牌，并在全球范围内打造了海尔、卡萨帝、Leader等品牌矩阵，实现对超高端、高端、主流及细分市场的全面覆盖，如今海尔已经连续 17 年位居全球大型家电品牌零售量第一。 ... 目前，海尔海外收入占比已超过50%，业务已覆盖全球200多个国家和地区，在中国、美国、澳大利亚、泰国等近30个国家实现行业TOP5，全球品牌渗透力与用户认可度行业领先。 ... 海尔集团董事局主席、首席执行官周云杰接受采访时表示，全球化正从1.0时代迈向区域化、本土化的2.0时代。全球化2.0时代，最好的全球化是最深的本土化。这背后是覆盖全球的研发体系作为核心支撑：依托全球“10+N”开放创新体系和HOPE创新生态平台，海尔链接了全球超过25万专家和100多万生态方共创，能够快速捕捉全球市场下的用户需求，保障了智慧成果能够迅速从实验室走向用户家中。 ... 今年夏季，欧洲多国遭遇极端高温，海尔依托本地化运营体系迅速响应，针对性推出适配当地用户需求的产品：针对欧洲老房“打孔难、安装贵”的痛点，推出Expert系列易安装空调；针对当地高电价问题，推出Pearl Premium系列，全系达标欧盟A+++顶级能效。今年上半年，海尔空调在欧洲市场稳居中国品牌第一，法国、英国、德国等西欧国家6月份增幅接近140%。 ... 如今，海尔不仅将智能产品带向全球，也推动着海尔的智慧家庭解决方案走向全球：可识别食材的冰箱，智能识别衣物材质的洗衣机，具备防溢锅保护的烟机等，从产品到场景演进，海尔让全球用户共享智慧家庭体验。以智慧家庭场景为引领，海尔自主研发智慧家庭垂域大模型Uhome，能理解复杂指令并连续对话；欧洲hOn、美国SmartHQ、东南亚Haismart智能平台服务全球千万级用户，引领全球智慧家庭发展。 ... 通过沉淀成熟的全球化经验，海尔持续赋能产业生态出海。海尔布局智慧家庭、大健康、数字经济、机器人、新能源、汽车六大产业生态，协同出海构建了一个可自我调节的智慧生命体。 ... 在大健康产业，盈康一生旗下海尔生物2025年海外收入同比增长17.9%，占主营收入比重提升至36%，超低温及低温系列产品在英国、意大利、澳大利亚等6个国家市场份额位居第一。2025年，海尔生物与泰国RAM医疗集团签署战略合作协议，在药房自动化、智慧医疗全场景等领域展开深度协同。 ... 在数字经济产业，卡奥斯工业互联网平台将“灯塔工厂”经验向全球复制，现已覆盖全球超20多个国家。今年6月，卡奥斯打造的海仕达智能科技新工厂在泰国罗勇府奠基，该工厂将以智能控制器行业首个全流程AI智能应用互联工厂为目标，规划最大产能2200万台/年；海纳云将数字孪生数字化解决方案落地全球10多个国家的61个城市，涵盖数字应急、市政、政府等多个领域。 ... 在新能源产业，海尔新能源布局绿能、储能、智控器三大业务领域，三年内跻身独角兽企业行列在三年内成长为“全球独角兽企业”，业务版图已拓展至全球50多个国家和地区。 ... 强大的生态品牌势能是海尔穿越经济周期、实现长远发展的坚实基础。目前海尔通过技术、品牌、生态的协同发力，已进入“高质量出海”新阶段，在全球舞台上书写中国品牌向上生长的崭新篇章。
HAIER,,,,Exa,LG H&H's Haitai htb Bidding Success Sparks Coca-Cola Beverage Sale Speculation | Gate News,www.gate.com,2026-07-27T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-27 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.gate.com/news/detail/lg-hhs-haitai-htb-bidding-success-sparks-coca-cola-beverage-sale-23036309,"LG H&H's Haitai htb Bidding Success Sparks Coca-Cola Beverage Sale Speculation | Gate News ... LG H&H's Haitai htb Bidding Success Sparks Coca-Cola Beverage Sale Speculation ... # LG H&H's Haitai htb Bidding Success Sparks Coca-Cola Beverage Sale Speculation ... - LG Household & Health Care's Haitai htb subsidiary attracted five to six parties submitting letters of intent during preliminary bidding on July 24. - Coca-Cola Beverage recorded 1.5965 trillion won revenue and 151 billion won operating profit in 2025 with approximately ten percent margin. - Any Coca-Cola Beverage sale requires consultation with Coca-Cola headquarters due to bottling partnership and management rights transfer requirements. ... LG Household & Health Care's beverage subsidiary Haitai htb attracted multiple bidders in preliminary bidding on July 24, with 5-6 or more parties submitting letters of intent according to investment banking industry sources on July 28. The bidding success has renewed market speculation about whether LG H&H might subsequently sell Coca-Cola Beverage, its larger beverage subsidiary, as part of ongoing business restructuring efforts to strengthen its core cosmetics operations. Industry experts note that while Coca-Cola Beverage represents a valuable asset, any sale faces significant structural barriers due to partnership agreements with Coca-Cola headquarters and the complexity of transferring bottling rights alongside equity ownership. ... On July 24, LG Household & Health Care's subsidiary Haitai htb held preliminary bidding that drew participation from multiple potential acquirers. Investment banking industry sources reported that 5-6 or more parties submitted letters of intent. Samjung KPMG serves as the lead underwriter for the transaction. ... Following the Haitai htb bidding success, market observers have revived speculation about a potential Coca-Cola Beverage sale. The theory suggests LG H&H might first divest loss-making Haitai htb, then consider selling the larger and more core Coca-Cola Beverage operations. This speculation stems from LG H&H's stated focus on strengthening its primary cosmetics business, which faces challenges from indie brand competition and key market difficulties. The Haitai htb sale is interpreted as part of efforts to secure resources for cosmetics competitiveness enhancement. LG H&H has consistently described Coca-Cola Beverage sale rumors as ""groundless."" ... Investment banking industry experts cite the Coca-Cola partnership structure as a major barrier to any near-term sale. LG H&H owns 90% of Coca-Cola Beverage, while a US Coca-Cola affiliate holds the remaining 10%. Coca-Cola Beverage operates as a bottling producer that receives concentrate from Coca-Cola headquarters, then manufactures and distributes products domestically. Any acquirer must inherit not only company management rights but also partner status for long-term production and sales of Coca-Cola brands in Korea. Management rights transfer requires consultation with Coca-Cola headquarters. The transaction effectively involves both LG H&H selecting a buyer and Coca-Cola headquarters choosing a new domestic business partner. This differs from Haitai htb, where external brand contracts like Minute Maid represent only a portion of operations—Haitai htb can continue business centered on proprietary brands like Bong Bong and Gala Mandun Bae even if some external brand contracts terminate. ... Investment banking industry sources describe the potential acquirer pool as limited. Coca-Cola Beverage operates nationwide production, logistics, and sales organizations plus distribution networks with major retailers and food service companies. Small and mid-sized strategic investors lacking capital strength or beverage/consumer goods experience would find operations challenging. Private equity fund acquisitions also face difficulties—funds must recover investments after a set period, meaning Coca-Cola Beverage management rights could return to market within years. Coca-Cola headquarters may view repeated ownership changes as burdensome after selecting a long-term domestic operations partner. Fund managers would face investment recovery constraints if future resale requires Coca-Cola headquarters consultation. ... Coca-Cola Beverage recorded revenue of 1.5965 trillion won and operating profit of 151 billion won in 2025. These figures represent decreases from 2024 revenue of 1.6357 trillion won and operating profit of 164.1 billion won, but the company maintains an operating profit margin approaching 10%. The high brand recognition and stable cash generation capability remain factors that could attract potential acquirer interest. ... Multiple bidders participated in Haitai htb preliminary bidding on July 24, with 5-6 or more parties submitting letters of intent according to investment banking industry sources. Samjung KPMG serves as the lead underwriter for the transaction. ... Experts cite the bottling partnership with Coca-Cola headquarters as a major barrier. Any acquirer must inherit both management rights and partner status for producing and selling Coca-Cola brands in Korea, requiring consultation with Coca-Cola headquarters during ownership transfer. LG H&H owns 90% of Coca-Cola Beverage while a US Coca-Cola affiliate holds 10%. ... Coca-Cola Beverage recorded revenue of 1.5965 trillion won and operating profit of 151 billion won in 2025, maintaining an operating profit margin approaching 10% despite decreases from 2024 figures of 1.6357 trillion won in revenue and 164.1 billion won in operating profit. ... 19h agoLG Health's Haetae HTB Auction Attracts 5-6 Bidders; Coca-Cola Beverage Sale Seen as Unlikely Near-Term"
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier supplies appliances for new Canterbury development - kbbreview,www.kbbreview.com (Matt Baker),2026-07-22T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-22 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.kbbreview.com/86397/news/haier-supplies-appliances-for-new-canterbury-development/,"Haier supplies appliances for new Canterbury development - kbbreview ... Haier has partnered with housebuilder Fernham Homes to supply integrated kitchen appliances for a new residential development at Blean, near Canterbury. ... The partnership will see Haier provide appliances for 59 private three and four-bedroom homes, with each property featuring a fully integrated kitchen fitted with the manufacturer’s products. ... The specification includes ID Series 2 electric ovens with hydrolytic cleaning and air fryer functionality, ID Series 2 induction hobs, built-in refrigerators from the ID Titanium and 55 Series 6 ranges, Washlens Plus integrated dishwashers with 16-place settings, and I-Pro Series 3 washing machines. ... According to Haier, the partnership began after Fernham Homes attended a product demonstration at the manufacturer’s Design Activation Centre at the Business Design Centre in Islington. The facility showcases Haier’s cooking, refrigeration, laundry and small domestic appliance ranges. ... A four-bedroom show home at the Blean development is now open to the public and includes a fully integrated Haier kitchen. ... Jim McEwan, managing director UK & Ireland at Haier UK, said: “Partnering with Fernham Homes allows us to bring our vision of the modern connected kitchen directly into new homes, giving new home buyers immediate access to premium, high-performance appliances. ... Sean Ellis, managing director at Fernham Homes, added: “When selecting appliances for this development, it was important for us to find a partner that could deliver on quality, design and technology, while remaining accessible for buyers. ... ier stood out for its combination of innovative features, contemporary styling and overall value, allowing us to create kitchens that feel premium, functional and ready for modern living.” ... Haier said the agreement expands its presence in the UK new-build housing market by supplying integrated appliance packages for residential developments. ... 1. Haier Europe appoints new CFO 2. Haier signs global football deals with Liverpool and PSG 3. Haier targets the smart-home at One Vision conference 4. Haier names new MD for UK and Ireland"
HAIER,,,,Exa,全国首个！海尔承建家居家电方向国家人工智能应用中试基地 - 海尔集团官网,www.haier.com,2026-07-21T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-21 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/press-events/news/20260721_293366.shtml,全国首个！海尔承建家居家电方向国家人工智能应用中试基地 - 海尔集团官网 ... 首页新闻资讯全国首个！海尔承建家居家电方向国家人工智能应用中试基地 ... 全国首个！海尔承建家居家电方向国家人工智能应用中试基地 ... 2026.07.20 ... 7月17日，2026世界人工智能大会暨人工智能全球治理高级别会议（WAIC）在上海启幕。这场汇聚全球前沿技术与产业落地成果的行业盛会，正成为观测产业AI化的重要窗口。 ... 在当日下午举行的“人工智能+消费”主题论坛上，海尔集团高级副总裁、海尔智家董事长兼总裁李华刚发表主题演讲，并正式宣布：海尔智家将承建国家人工智能应用中试基地（消费领域·家居家电方向）。 ... 海尔智家将承建的国家人工智能应用中试基地由商务部推荐、国家发改委审批设立，是全国首个家居家电方向的国家人工智能应用中试基地。 ... 这恰好道出了这座国家级中试基地的战略价值：它要解决的，正是AI从“企业自用”到“行业共享”的转化难题。 ... 它的落地标志着AI赋能消费领域迈出了关键一步。从产业视角来看，企业内部AI落地只能实现单点竞争力的提升——只有带动全行业共同智能化升级，AI技术才能真正规模化走进千家万户，释放产业整体价值。 ... 具体而言，该基地由海尔智家牵头，联合行业机构、高校院所及众多企业共同参与建设。目标是打造全球引领的“新一代智慧家电”场景中试基地——汇聚行业需求与AI技术资源，推动龙头企业形成国际引领；同时沉淀能力与标准化方案，赋能广大中小企业快速提升智能化水平，推动AI真正规模化走进千家万户。 ... 这是一次从“企业自用 ... 全行业普惠AI”的升级探索——以技术范式升级驱动产业跃迁，最终以产业跃迁带动消费升级。 ... 海尔能承建这一基地，正是其AI落地成果走在行业前列、获得国家级认可的有力印证。目前，海尔智家已构筑了AI能力底座，从用户、企业两大维度全面推进AI落地。 ... 尔智家正通过AI产品、AI场景、AI生活，提供一站式智慧生活解决方案。 ... AI产品：海尔智家让整套家电拥有感知、思考、主动服务的能力。例如在厨房里，AI之眼能帮您看管锅里的食物防止溢锅，还能识别冰箱里的食材推荐菜谱，联动烤箱自动预热，让烹饪从容高效。 ... AI场景：海尔智家依托家庭AI智能体小优Agent，探索从分担家务迈向“无人家务”。小优Agent能理解空间布局、物品位置与人的行为习惯，在美食、洗护、空气、用水等场景主动规划、自主决策、自动执行。 ... AI生活：海尔智家以AI Agent为核心，为用户提供“人-车-家-社区”的智慧生活体验。用户上车可一键开启离家模式，自动关闭家中设备，免去折返检查的麻烦。返程可提前开启家中空调，车辆驶入小区后，地库、电梯、居家场景自动联动触发，全程无需手动操作，让归家体验更加便捷舒适。 ... 海尔智家依托H-work统一平台搭建了超级智能体“智小能”、轻应用“一念”和企业级应用“无界”三大核心应用。目前，“智小能”覆盖人数已达6万余人，智能应用超1.4万个，75%的Token消耗来自员工日常使用，AI已深度融入从内部办公到外部生态的全新工作模式。 ... 从单一产品的功能，到智能互联体验，再到AI时代主动感知、自主响应的个性化服务，海尔智家正在从家电企业全面蜕变为平台服务型科技生态企业。随着国家人工智能应用中试基地的落地，海尔智家将以产业跃迁带动消费升级，让智慧走进每一个家庭，持续为用户提供美好生活解决方案。
HAIER,,,,Exa,海尔智家承建国家AI应用中试基地 - 海尔集团官网,www.haier.com,2026-07-21T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-21 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/press-events/news/20260721_293371.shtml,海尔智家承建国家AI应用中试基地 - 海尔集团官网 海尔智家承建国家AI应用中试基地 2026.07.20 来源： 人民网 7月17日，2026世界人工智能大会暨人工智能全球治理高级别会议在上海开幕。在当日下午举行的“人工智能+消费”论坛上，海尔智家董事长兼总裁李华刚现场分享了全面推进AI落地、向平台服务型科技生态企业转型的最新实践成果，并宣布海尔智家将承建聚焦消费领域·家居家电方向的国家人工智能应用中试基地。 ... 据介绍，该基地由商务部推荐、国家发改委审批设立，是全国首个家居家电方向的人工智能应用中试基地。它的落地，意味着AI赋能消费领域迈出了关键一步。基地致力于解决AI技术从“企业自用”到“行业共享”的转化难题，让AI技术形成可复制、可推广的标准化方案，以全行业的智能化跃迁带动AI消费升级。 ... 在技术维度，能够承建这一基地，代表海尔智家的AI技术成果获得了国家级认可。在人工智能领域，海尔智家已实现智慧家庭发明专利全球14连冠。2026AWE期间，搭载AI之眼2.0的海尔Seeker套系，成为中家院认证的行业首个L4级智能体家电套系，是目前行业最高等级；依托智慧家庭垂域操作系统UHomeOS，海尔智家实现了全空间、全场景的“主动服务”，并通过布局家务、清洁、陪伴三大类机器人，做到与智慧家电“组队干家务”；在7月广州建博会上，海尔智家还发布了搭载家庭空间知识图谱的AI Agent系统——小优Agent。 ... 技术，海 ... 家也在用AI重塑企业流程。其依托H-work统一平台搭建了 ... 智能体“智小能 ... 轻应用“一 ... 和企业级应用“ ... 。目前，“智 ... 覆盖人数已达6 ... ，智能应用 ... AI赋能 ... token消耗来自员工日常使用 ... 家行业引领 ... 在应用维度，海尔智家在AI领域的技术优势，已全面转化为融入用户生活的智慧体验。AI产品层面，海尔智家通过100%网器化产品，让整套家电拥有了感知、思考、主动服务的能力。AI场景层面，海尔智家正带领行业从“分担家务”走向“无人家务”，小优Agent能在美食、洗护、空气、用水等生活全场景中实现主动规划、自主决策、自动执行。AI生活层面，海尔智家以AI Agent为核心构建“人-车-家-社区”的智慧生活体验。 ... 截至2025年，海尔智慧家庭全球累计注册用户数已超过1.3亿，全年智慧场景交互次数累计达861亿次，月均超70亿次调用。今年3月，海尔智家还获得了欧睿国际“全球智慧家庭销售额第一企业”认证。技术上的国家认同、应用上的用户认可，构成了海尔智家承建这一国家级平台的双重背书。让AI真正从实验室走进千家万户，不仅需要头部企业的率先突破，更需要一套可复制、可推广的行业标准与公共能力。未来，随着基地向行业持续开放技术能力与标准化成果，AI消费有望规模化走进千家万户，智慧家庭将真正从少数人的尝鲜变成普通家庭的生活常态。
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Group Partners with a Cambodian Company to Establish Cambodia’s First Tablet Assembly Plant | អង្គភាព​ព័ត៌មាន​ និងប្រតិកម្មរហ័ស,pressocm.gov.kh,2026-07-17T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-17 00:00:00+00:00,,https://pressocm.gov.kh/en/archives/124219,"Haier Group Partners with a Cambodian Company to Establish Cambodia’s First Tablet Assembly Plant | អង្គភាពព័ត៌មាន និងប្រតិកម្មរហ័ស ... # Haier Group Partners with a Cambodian Company to Establish Cambodia’s First Tablet Assembly Plant ... 17 July, 2026 ... On the afternoon of 15 July 2026, Samdech Moha Borvor Thipadei HUN Manet, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, received a courtesy call from Mr Diao Yunfeng, Vice President of Haier Group, on the occasion of his working visit to the People’s Republic of China and his participation in the 2026 World AI Conference, held from 15 to 17 July 2026. ... During the meeting, the Vice President briefed Samdech Thipadei on the business operations of Haier Group, one of the world’s leading enterprises, which manufactures smart home appliances and equipment and provides digital transformation solutions. The company currently operates in more than 60 countries and serves approximately 44 million users worldwide. He also updated Samdech Thipadei on the company’s investment plans in Cambodia, highlighting its partnership with a Cambodian company to establish the country’s first tablet assembly plant. The project aims to provide affordable tablets to students and workers in the informal economy, thereby expanding access to digital technology and supporting online learning. ... In response, Samdech Thipadei congratulated Haier Group on its successful business operations. He emphasised that the Royal Government of Cambodia consistently welcomes and supports investors and has introduced a wide range of incentive policies designed to facilitate successful investment in Cambodia. Samdech Thipadei also highly appreciated and welcomed the project to manufacture affordable tablets, noting that it would make a significant contribution to advancing digital transformation in the education sector and strengthening human resource development in Cambodia. ... At the same time, Samdech Thipadei encouraged the company to maintain close engagement with its Cambodian partner, as well as with the relevant ministries and institutions of the Royal Government of Cambodia, in order to maximise the opportunities provided by the Royal Government’s investment incentive policies and further expand its investment in Cambodia. ... 7 July, ... 2026 ... 7 July,"
HAIER,,,,Exa,PM Hun Manet urges Haier Group to expand technology investment in Cambodia - Khmer Times,www.khmertimeskh.com (Vishnu),2026-07-16T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-16 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.khmertimeskh.com/501944605/pm-hun-manet-urges-haier-group-to-expand-technology-investment-in-cambodia/,"PM Hun Manet urges Haier Group to expand technology investment in Cambodia - Khmer Times ... ## PM Hun Manet urges Haier Group to expand technology investment in Cambodia ... Prime Minister Hun Manet has urged China’s Haier Group to expand its investment in Cambodia’s technology sector, reaffirming the government’s commitment to developing technology as a key pillar of the country’s future economic growth. ... The appeal came during a courtesy meeting with Haier Group Vice President Diao Yunfeng on Wednesday, held as part of the Prime Minister’s official visit to China from Wednesday until Friday. ... During the meeting, Mr Hun Manet and Diao discussed opportunities to broaden Haier Group’s operations in Cambodia, particularly in advanced technology and manufacturing. ... He highlighted the government’s commitment to attracting high-quality technology investment that supports innovation, develops local human resources and promotes sustainable technology transfer. ... The discussions reflected Cambodia’s broader strategy of positioning itself as an attractive destination for leading global technology companies as it pursues its long-term ambition of becoming a high-income country by 2050. ... Founded in 1984 and headquartered in Qingdao, Shandong province, Haier Group is a Chinese multinational corporation with businesses spanning smart home appliances, Internet of Things (IoT) ecosystems, smart energy and the industrial internet. ... According to the company, Haier Group generated global revenue of 426.8 billion yuan (approximately $59.8 billion) and profit of 32.2 billion yuan (around $4.5 billion) last year. The Group employs around 146,000 people worldwide and has eight subsidiaries. It has also been ranked the world’s leading major home appliance brand by market share by Euromonitor International for 17 consecutive years. ... Haier Group is already expanding its presence in Cambodia through its subsidiary Haier Haitech, which has partnered with SAM SN GROUP to establish KH Haitech Co Ltd. ... The joint venture is developing Cambodia’s first tablet manufacturing plant with an initial investment of approximately $10 million. Scheduled to begin operations next year, the facility aims to produce 10,000 tablets in its first phase under the Cambodian-owned K Haitech brand, using technology provided by Haier Group. ... KH Haitech has completed trademark registration for the brand and is currently applying for the necessary licences from the relevant authorities. ... The project is intended to support Cambodia’s Industry 4.0 agenda by helping expand access to affordable digital devices for education, vocational training and informal workers. It is also expected to contribute to digital transformation in sectors such as healthcare and smart manufacturing. ... Looking ahead, KH Haitech plans to establish modern automated manufacturing facilities and green industrial zones in Cambodia to strengthen local production capacity, create employment opportunities, develop digital skills and reduce reliance on imported electronic products, while supporting the sustainable growth of the country’s digital economy."
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Partners With Cambodian Firm to Establish Country’s First Tablet Assembly Plant – Kampucheathmey Daily,en.kampucheathmey.com (In Sopheng),2026-07-16T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-16 00:00:00+00:00,,https://en.kampucheathmey.com/economy/1142788/,"Haier Partners With Cambodian Firm to Establish Country’s First Tablet Assembly Plant – Kampucheathmey Daily ... # Haier Partners With Cambodian Firm to Establish Country’s First Tablet Assembly Plant ... BEIJING, July 16, 2026 (KPT) – Chinese home appliance and technology giant Haier Group has partnered with a Cambodian company to establish the country’s first tablet assembly plant, officials said Thursday, in a move expected to expand access to affordable digital devices and support Cambodia’s digital transformation. ... The investment plan was announced during Prime Minister Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet’s meeting with Haier Vice President Diao Yunfeng on July 15, part of his official visit to China and participation in the 2026 World AI Conference. Diao briefed the Prime Minister on Haier’s global operations, noting the company serves 44 million users worldwide across more than 60 countries. ... He outlined plans to produce affordable tablets for students and informal workers, aiming to boost digital access and promote distance learning. Hun Manet welcomed the initiative, describing it as a key project to accelerate Cambodia’s digital transformation in education and strengthen human resource development. ... The Prime Minister reaffirmed the government’s commitment to supporting investors through incentive policies and encouraged Haier to deepen cooperation with its Cambodian partner and relevant ministries. ... The announcement formed part of Samdech ThipadeiHun Manet’s July 15–17 visit to China, during which Cambodia is seeking to attract high-quality investment in technology, manufacturing and digital innovation."
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier akan luncurkan produk berbasis AI di Indonesia - ANTARA News,www.antaranews.com (antaranews.com),2026-07-16T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-16 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.antaranews.com/berita/5652231/haier-akan-luncurkan-produk-berbasis-ai-di-indonesia,"Haier akan luncurkan produk berbasis AI di Indonesia - ANTARA News # Haier akan luncurkan produk berbasis AI di Indonesia ... Qingdao (ANTARA) - Produsen peralatan rumah tangga asal China, Haier, akan meluncurkan produk premium berbasis kecerdasan buatan (AI) secara bertahap di Indonesia. ... ""Saat ini kami telah memasuki era kecerdasan buatan atau AI. Kami memiliki berbagai produk serta produk rumah pintar berbasis AI dan akan meluncurkan seluruh produk tersebut di Indonesia secara bertahap,"" kata Vice President of Haier Smart Home Overseas, Zhang Qingfu, di kantor pusat Haier di Qingdao, Provinsi Shandong, Kamis. ... Haier di Indonesia hadir sejak 2011 dengan mengakuisisi bisnis Sanyo Electric, termasuk seluruh operasional di Indonesia dan mendirikan perusahaan baru dengan nama PT Haier Electrical Appliances Indonesia (HEI). ... Perusahaan tersebut mengoperasikan pabrik di kawasan EJIP Industrial Park, Cikarang sejak 2012 dengan menggunakan merek ""AQUA"" yang memproduksi lemari es, air conditioner (AC), mesin cuci, ""cold chain freezer"", hingga televisi dengan kapasitas produksi 2 juta unit. Pada April 2026 lalu, HEI pun telah memproduksi unit ke-10 juta ... ""Indonesia merupakan pasar yang penting bagi kami. Kami telah mendirikan pabrik serta perusahaan distributor di Indonesia untuk membantu kami melayani konsumen di Indonesia,"" tambah Zhang. ... Zhang menyebut produk pending ... AC menjadi produk ungg ... di Indonesia. ... Zhang pun menyebut Haier saat ini menguasai 10 persen pangsa pasar peralatan rumah tangga besar di Indonesia pada 2025 dan menempati posisi nomor satu di antara merek-merek asal China. ... Untuk meningkatkan pangsa pasar di Indonesia, Zhang mengatakan perusahaan itu selalu mempertimbangkan kebutuhan konsumen dan mengembangkan produk yang dapat memenuhi kebutuhan tersebut. ... ""Selain mengembangkan AC dengan fitur pembersihan mandiri, kami juga mengembangkan berbagai produk lemari es dengan teknologi yang kami sebut sebagai 'full-space freshness', yaitu teknologi untuk menjaga kesegaran di seluruh ruang lemari es,"" tambah Zhang. ... Selain itu ada juga lemari es seri Horizon dengan kapasitas mencapai sekitar 700 liter yang dapat membantu keluarga yang terdiri atas sekitar lima orang untuk menyimpan sayuran, buah-buahan dan bahan makanan lainnya dalam jumlah besar. ... Selama berbisnis di Indonesia, Zhang yang ikut melakukan survei terhadap pasar di Indonesia pada 2002 itu mengaku punya banyak tantangan misalnya karena Indonesia memiliki banyak pulau. ... ""Karena itu, transportasi dan logistik menjadi tantangan. Kami berusaha membangun lebih banyak pusat distribusi atau pusat distribusi regional. Kami menggunakan jaringan gudang agar dapat memasok produk kepada konsumen dengan lebih cepat dan dengan biaya yang lebih rendah,"" jelas Zhang. ... Zhang berharap dapat memperoleh dukungan dari pemerintah Indonesia baik lokal maupun pusat, maupun pemerintah China sehingga dapat memperoleh lingkungan usaha yang baik. ... ""Hal yang dapat kami lakukan adalah memanfaatkan lingkungan bisnis yang baik tersebut untuk memperluas bisnis, membangun lebih banyak fasilitas, serta memberikan kontribusi yang lebih besar kepada masyarakat dan perekonomian lokal,"" kata Zhang. ... Pada 2025, pendapatan global disebut mencapai 300 miliar RMB (sekitar Rp683 triliun) dan laba bersih mencapai 19,55 miliar RMB (tumbuh 4,39 persen). Perusahaan ini diketahui juga mengakuisisi berbagai merek global seperti GE Appliances di Amerika Serikat, Fisher & Paykel di Selandia Baru, dan Candy di Eropa. ... Di pasar domestik China, Haier juga cukup mendominasi pangsa pasar penjualan luring untuk produk lemari es yaitu mencapai 47,7 persen, mesin cuci 47,4 persen, dan pemanas air 32,5 persen berdasarkan data GfK. ... Selain merek utama Haier, perusahaan itu juga punya merek premium bernama ""Casarte"" untuk pasar kelas atas di China dan merek ""Leader"" untuk pasar massal. ... Haier Gelar Turnamen Tenis Remaja dan Program Interaksi Penggemar di Roland-Garros 2026 Lewat Clay Court Open dan Fans Club Event ... ### Haier Gelar Turnamen Tenis Remaja dan Program Interaksi Penggemar di Roland-Garros 2026 Lewat Clay Court Open dan Fans Club Event ... Haier Kembali Jadi Mitra Resmi Roland-Garros 2026, Hadirkan Inovasi Berbasis Kepedulian bagi Konsumen Global ### Haier Kembali Jadi Mitra Resmi Roland-Garros 2026, Hadirkan Inovasi Berbasis Kepedulian bagi Konsumen Global Haier Kembali Jadi Mitra Resmi Roland-Garros 2026, Hadirkan Inovasi Berbasis Kepedulian bagi Konsumen Global - 4 Juni 2026 ... Haier Luncurkan Kulkas Seri Horizon di Vietnam, Hadirkan Standar Baru untuk Kesegaran Makanan dan Desain Peralatan Rumah Tangga ### Haier Luncurkan Kulkas Seri Horizon di Vietnam, Hadirkan Standar Baru untuk Kesegaran Makanan dan Desain Peralatan Rumah Tangga Haier Luncurkan Kulkas Seri Horizon di Vietnam, Hadirkan Standar Baru untuk Kesegaran Makanan dan Desain Peralatan Rumah Tangga ... - 3 Juni 2026 ... Haier Biomedical Raih Dua Peringkat Teratas dalam Laporan Euromonitor tentang Penjualan Peralatan Laboratorium Ilmu Hayati di Pasar Global ... ### Haier Biomedical Raih Dua Peringkat Teratas dalam Laporan Euromonitor tentang Penjualan Peralatan Laboratorium Ilmu Hayati di Pasar Global ... Haier Biomedical Raih Dua Peringkat Teratas dalam Laporan Euromonitor tentang Penjualan Peralatan Laboratorium Ilmu Hayati di Pasar Global ... ;DPE ... 2026 ... ### Haier dan Departemen Pendidikan Jasmani Thailand Gelar ""DPE x Haier CUP 2026"" ... Departemen Pendidikan Jasmani Thailand ... Haier Resmi Jadi Sponsor Utama Al Ahly FC Selama Empat Tahun, Sponsor Utama Kedua Al Ahly ... ### Haier Resmi Jadi Sponsor Utama Al Ahly FC Selama Empat Tahun, Sponsor Utama Kedua Al Ahly ... Haier Resmi Jadi Sponsor Utama Al Ahly FC Selama Empat Tahun, Sponsor Utama Kedua Al Ahly ... Haier Jadi Satu-satunya Merek Ekosistem IoT yang Tercantum dalam Daftar ""Kantar BrandZ Top 100"" Selama Delapan Tahun Berturut-turut ... ### Haier Jadi Satu-satunya Merek Ekosistem IoT yang Tercantum dalam Daftar ""Kantar BrandZ Top 100"" Selama Delapan Tahun Berturut-turut ... Haier Jadi Satu-satunya Merek Ekosistem IoT yang Tercantum dalam Daftar ""Kantar BrandZ Top 100"" Selama Delapan Tahun Berturut-turut ... Haier dan Fisher & Paykel Semakin Solid di Segmen Premium, Hadirkan Terobosan untuk Kehidupan yang Lebih Baik ... ### Haier dan Fisher & Paykel Semakin Solid di Segmen Premium, Hadirkan Terobosan untuk Kehidupan yang Lebih Baik ... Haier dan Fisher &amp ... Paykel Semakin Solid di Segmen Premium, Hadirkan Terobosan untuk Kehidupan yang Lebih Baik ... Haier Rayakan Keunggulan di Paris dengan Portofolio ""Smart Home"" Terbaru ... ### Haier Rayakan Keunggulan di Paris dengan Portofolio ""Smart Home"" Terbaru ... Haier Rayakan Keunggulan di Paris dengan Portofolio ""Smart Home"" Terbaru"
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Energy Showcases E-Tower Ultra Residential BESS,taiyangnews.info (Rajeshwari Gattu),2026-07-14T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-14 00:00:00+00:00,,https://taiyangnews.info/technology/haier-energy-showcases-e-tower-ultra-residential-bess,"Haier Energy Showcases E-Tower Ultra Residential BESS ... Haier Energy Showcases E-Tower Ultra Residential BESS ... The residential all-in-one ESS combines stackable battery storage, a hybrid inverter, and home energy management features ... at Intersolar Europe 2026. ... Jul 14, 2026, 10:33 ... - Haier Energy showcased E-Tower, a stackable residential BESS, at Intersolar Europe 2026 - The system combines 8 kWh battery modules with a hybrid inverter with a capacity ranging from 8 kW to 20 kW - According to the company, the system integrates with Haier's smart home ecosystem and supports backup power applications ... Haier Energy, the renewable energy business of Chinese home appliance manufacturer Haier Group, showcased its E-Tower Ultra, a stackable residential BESS that combines battery storage, hybrid inverter technology, and smart home connectivity at Intersolar Europe 2026. Speaking to TaiyangNews, Kaustubh Dhamale, European After Sales Engineer at Haier Energy, said the BESS is built around 8 kWh stackable battery modules, with each module incorporating its own battery management system (BMS). The system is paired with a hybrid inverter available in power ratings from 8 kW to 20 kW. According to Dhamale, the 20 kW hybrid inverter supports up to 40 kWp of PV input and features 4 MPPTs. ... Highlighting ease of deployment, Dhamale said the system requires less than 10 minutes for installation. He added that users can connect up to 6 battery modules in a single tower configuration, while recommending 4 battery modules for a typical installation. According to Dhamale, up to 10 systems can also be connected in parallel to increase the overall storage capacity. ... For backup applications, Haier Energy also showcased its backup box, which supports the integration of external inverters, heat pumps, and diesel generators. Dhamale said these connected devices can be monitored and controlled through the Haier Energy app. ... Another feature he highlighted was integration with Haier's Home Ecosystem. Dhamale said customers using Haier smart appliances can connect the inverter to the ecosystem, allowing the appliances to work together to provide an improved user experience."
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Biomedical International Revenue Hits 36% of Sales,novapharmanews.com,2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-10 00:00:00+00:00,,https://novapharmanews.com/apac/news/haier-biomedical-international-revenue-growth-2025,"Haier Biomedical International Revenue Hits 36% of Sales ... # Haier Biomedical Reports Record 36% International Revenue Growth in Life Science Infrastructure Market Sophie Martin Market Analysis Editor Reviewed by James Park Regulatory Affairs Editor Friday, May 1, 2026 2 min read Updated Aug 7, 2026 Visual context for ... Haier Biomedical achieves 36% international revenue share with $340.77M total revenue, driving AI-powered life science infrastructure expansion globally. ... Haier Biomedical (688139.SH) reported record international revenue of $122.68 million in 2025, representing 36% of total sales. This 17.9% year-over-year growth reflects the company's successful transition from domestic manufacturer to global life science tools leader. ... - Haier Biomedical's 2025 annual report filed with the Shanghai Stock Exchange shows total revenue of 2.33 billion yuan ($340.77 million USD), with international business reaching a record 36% share for the first time - Overseas revenue grew 17.9% year-over-year to 840 million yuan ($122.68 million USD), outpacing the domestic market where revenue declined 5.5% - The company ranks No. 1 globally in life science laboratory equipment sales and No. 1 in overseas sales among Chinese brands, according to Euromonitor International - AI-powered intelligent productivity platforms now generate 15% of total revenue; Haier Biomedical aims to exceed 30% AI-related revenue in the near term - Net profit attributable to shareholders declined 31.61% to CNY 250.73 million due to strategic investments in global expansion and AI infrastructure, according to company investor relations ... Qingdao Haier Biomedical Co., Ltd. has evolved from a domestic medical equipment supplier into a global life science infrastructure player. The company operates in over 150 countries and has established overseas research and development centers in the United Kingdom, Italy, and Japan. ... The company's leadership position rests on two pillars. First, it dominates the low-temperature storage equipment market for biomedical samples, offering complete cold chain solutions ranging from -196°C to +8°C. Second, its strategic pivot from product sales to intelligent productivity platforms addresses the critical need for automation and AI-driven laboratory operations. ... Haier Biomedical's international growth spans multiple continents. The company has achieved over 100% year-on-year growth in markets including Germany, Eastern Europe, and South Asia. It provides on-site support in Europe for Good Manufacturing Practice (GMP) compliance and air safety standards. ... Strategic partnerships accelerate market penetration. The company has secured supply chain relationships with multiple leading pharmaceutical companies globally. In 2019, Haier Biomedical won the UNICEF immunization tender and delivered pharmaceutical refrigerators to the Department of Health in the Philippines. Cold-chain refrigerators supplied for immunization programs must meet the World Health Organization's Performance, Quality and Safety (PQS) prequalification standards, the benchmark that governs vaccine cold-chain equipment procurement worldwide. ... Localization is central to the expansion strategy. Haier Biomedical is actively hiring sales managers for Central and Eastern Europe to build market presence and manage distributor relationships, demonstrating commitment to sustainable regional growth. ... Haier Biomedical's strategic transformation centers on artificial intelligence integration across its life science infrastructure portfolio. The company has transitioned from traditional equipment sales to comprehensive intelligent productivity platforms that enhance laboratory efficiency and operational optimization. ... - Five priorities: Deepening product innovation across sample management, blood safety, vaccine safety, medical supplies, and laboratory automation - Four transformations: Shifting from equipment to solutions, from domestic to global markets, from manual to intelligent systems, and from single products to integrated platforms - Three leaps: Market leap through geographic expansion, industry leap through strategic acquisitions, and model leap through AI-driven innovation ... ier Brain platform exemplifies ... . It connects ... terminal devices and enables ... making, transforming isolated hardware into collaborative systems. Notable achievements include AI-powered automated ... and fully automated cell workstations. ... Haier Biomedical has constructed a multi-layer AI infrastructure encompassing large language models, AI agents, and AI terminals. This technology now contributes meaningfully to the bottom line—AI-related revenue reached 15% of total revenue in 2025. ... The company projects AI-related revenue will exceed 30% in the near future. Key AI-driven products include fully automated cytotoxic drug compounding robots that digitize medication workflows and reduce human error. ... Research and development investment supports this AI push. R&D expenses increased by 5.58% to CNY 323 million in 2025, reflecting the company's commitment to innovation leadership. ... Haier Biomedical's 2025 performance establishes a foundation for continued international expansion. The 36% international revenue share demonstrates successful diversification beyond domestic markets, reducing geographic concentration risk while capitalizing on global healthcare modernization initiatives. ... The company's dividend policy signals confidence despite profit headwinds. Haier Biomedical proposed a cash dividend of CNY 4.7 per 10 shares, maintaining shareholder returns while funding strategic growth investments. ... Long-term, the company maintains its global expansion target of exceeding 50% international revenue share. This ambition aligns with industry trends toward automation and data-driven laboratory operations in life science facilities worldwide. ... Haier Biomedical reported total revenue of 2.33 billion yuan ($340.77 million USD) for fiscal year 2025, according to the company's annual report filed with the Shanghai Stock Exchange on March 29, 2025. ... Overseas revenue grew 17.9% year-over-year to 840 million yuan ($122.68 million USD), with international business now comprising a record 36% of total annual revenue for the first time in company history. ... Haier Biomedical is executing a ""543"" three-year strategic plan focused on three pillars: market leap (deepening global penetration), industry leap (expanding through strategic acquisitions), and model leap (driving AI-powered innovation through intelligent productivity platforms). ... According to Euromonitor International, Haier Biomedical ranks No. 1 globally in life science laboratory equipment sales and No. 1 in overseas sales among Chinese brands. ... Haier Biomedical has built a multi-layer AI infrastructure including large models, AI agents, and AI terminals. The company's Incaier Brain platform connects smart terminal devices and enables intelligent decision-making. AI-related revenue reached 15% of total revenue in 2025."
HAIER,,,,Exa,"Haier Europe Appoints Stagwell (STGW) as Creative Agency for the Haier Brand, Following Ingenuity+ Pitch Process",www.accessnewswire.com (Stagwell),2026-07-09T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-09 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.accessnewswire.com/newsroom/en/business-and-professional-services/haier-europe-appoints-stagwell-stgw-as-creative-agency-for-the-h-1188786,"Haier Europe Appoints Stagwell (STGW) as Creative Agency for the Haier Brand, Following Ingenuity+ Pitch Process ... # Haier Europe Appoints Stagwell (STGW) as Creative Agency for the Haier Brand, Following Ingenuity+ Pitch Process ... LONDON, GB / ACCESS Newswire/ July 9, 2026 / Today, Haier Europe appoints Stagwell (NASDAQ:STGW), the challenger network transforming marketing through AI, as its lead creative agency for the Haier Brand, following a competitive pitch process managed by Ingenuity+. ... Haier strives to deliver premium appliances powered by intelligent technology, naturally designed around customers, empowering them every day as their needs evolve. Stagwell was selected to support the Haier brand through its next phase of growth, bringing its ""More Creation, More Possibilities"" brand payoff to life through creative communications across Europe. ... Coordinated by a Client Service Team based in the Italian office, Stagwell will lead creative strategy and campaign development, helping the Haier brand in Europe to translate its vision into a consumer-relevant communication platform across markets and product lines. Stagwell's digital agency, Assembly Digital Commerce, will support with content for online and e-commerce channels. ... The agency will play a key role in developing scalable, consistent and modular content aligned with Haier's premium positioning and ambition to make intelligent technology feel more human, inspiring and relevant. ... Silvia Gregorio, Brand and Digital Activation Director at Haier Europe, said: ""The next growth phase for the Haier brand in Europe requires a strategic partner capable of fully understanding our brand values and working alongside the team to deliver inspiring content, consistent across teams and markets. Stagwell's international DNA, digital marketing expertise and collaborative approach will allow us to develop a strong, scalable communication strategy, focused on the real possibilities that the Haier ecosystem offers our consumers every day."" ... James Denton-Clark, Chief Growth & Client Officer, Stagwell Europe, said ""This win underscores how Stagwell Europe is evolving to meet changing client needs. Our flexible model allows us to bring together high-altitude creative that builds brand desire, and the precision execution that drives performance. We look forward to supporting Haier Europe's next phase of growth."" ... Gill Huber, Managing Partner at Ingenuity+, said: ""This was a focused and highly considered process designed to identify a partner capable of translating Haier's technology leadership into a distinctive and scalable European creative platform. Stagwell impressed the Haier team with the strength of its strategic thinking, digital-first approach, senior team and collaborative energy. We are delighted to have supported Haier through the process and look forward to seeing the partnership develop."" ... Haier is the appliance brand dedicated to consumers who want premium experiences. Advanced technology, superior design, and tailor-made experiences are the three souls of Haier, which offers a wide range of connected products and solutions in the sectors of washing, cooling, cooking, and conditioning appliances. The Haier brand is part of the Haier Smart Home Group and ranks number one in the global home major appliances (*Source: Euromonitor International Limited; Consumer Appliances 2026 Edition; % unit share, 2025 volume sales data) www.haier-europe.com."
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier launches propane air-to-water heat pump for commercial applications - pv magazine Global,www.pv-magazine.com (Emiliano Bellini),2026-07-08T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-08 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/08/haier-launches-propane-air-to-water-heat-pump-for-commercial-applications/,"Haier launches propane air-to-water heat pump for commercial applications - pv magazine Global ... # Haier launches propane air-to-water heat pump for commercial applications ... The new monobloc heat pump range uses propane refrigerant and is available in four versions from 26 kW to 40 kW. Haier says the system is designed for commercial buildings, retrofit projects, and applications requiring high-temperature water supply. ... China-based heat pump manufacturer Haier has introduced a new commercial air-to-water heat pump range for commercial heating applications, including office buildings, small commercial facilities, and retrofit projects where higher water temperatures are required. ... The new system uses R290 (propane) as refrigerant and is offered in four heating capacity classes: 26 kW, 30 kW, 35 kW and 40 kW. ... According to the company, the new monobloc system achieves A+++ seasonal energy efficiency and can provide leaving water temperatures of up to 80 C. The manufacturer also claims to system can achieve a seasonal coefficient of performance (SCOP) of 4.91. ... “It is possible for the unit to be cascaded up to eight units. Offering a scalable solution for larger projects and buildings with higher capacity demands with up to 320 kW capacity,” the company said in a statement. “The new unit is fitted with a refrigerant leak detector, refrigerant separator alongside a fully sealed electrical control box.” ... Haier also stated that the heat pump achieves sound levels from approximately 47 dB(A), with the low-noise design intended to improve suitability for urban and noise-sensitive commercial installations. ... The outdoor unit features a horizontal air discharge configuration, which Haier says enables more flexible installation in locations where space constraints are an issue. ... “The commercial range maintains 2 core wiring the same as the existing Haier residential heat pump range,” the company emphasized. “This makes installation consistent and easy to follow. Zone control allows flexibility and reassurance when it comes to climate control, ensuring any environment it comfortable depending on the users needs.”"
HAIER,,,,Exa,海尔：本土巧创新 清风通四海 - 海尔集团官网,www.haier.com,2026-07-08T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-08 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/press-events/news/20260708_292944.shtml,首页新闻资讯海尔：本土巧创新 清风通四海 ... 海尔：本土巧创新 清风通四海 ... 2026.07.08 ... 来源： 中国质量 ... 本报讯(记者朱文达)海尔集团公司(以下简称“海尔”)空调凭借本土化产品创新和全链路市场布局，在欧洲多国市场稳居前列，成为中国家电出海标杆品牌。 ... 依托本土化研发与产品创新优势，海尔空调精准适配欧洲市场特殊需求。针对当地历史建筑安装难、维保成本高的痛点，海尔推出Expert系列高端挂机，通过模块化、便捷化结构设计，大幅简化安装与维保流程，适配欧洲建筑标准，获得当地专业渠道认可。针对欧洲高电价及低碳政策要求，海尔专属打造的PearlPremium系列空调全系达到欧盟A+++顶级能效，在高效制冷的同时有效降低能耗，契合当地政策要求与民生使用需求。 ... 精准的产品布局助力海尔空调实现市场持续增长。数据显示，海尔暖通空调整体在欧洲市场增长近20%，自有品牌增长达23%，位列在欧中企首位。细分市场表现亮眼，在西班牙市场，海尔品牌终端单月及年度累计份额均位列行业第一，成为近6年来当地唯一能持续稳住双位数年度份额的空调品牌，5年复合增长率达34.5%，营收持续保持两位数同比增长；在意大利，海尔依托Supermatch成套解决方案持续拉高品牌溢价，实现专业渠道、一拖多产品销量双第一；在波兰，海尔家用空调整体份额位列第二，一拖多产品份额位居榜首，细分赛道优势突出。 ... 过硬的产品实力与市场口碑也获得官方认可。近期，法国巴黎第十七区政府采购一批海尔空调，投入辖区学校使用，有效解决高温天气下的校园降温难题，引发广泛社会关注。 ... 据业内人士分析，不同于行业部分品牌代工、低价贴牌的产品短期出海模式，海尔空调在欧洲搭建起研发、制造、营销、服务全链路本土化体系，具备更强的抗风险能力与增长韧性。在欧洲高温经济红利下，以海尔为代表的本土化、高品质中国家电品牌，将持续深耕海外市场，助力我国家电出口提质升级。 ... 上一篇：空调业唯一！海尔空调第四次拿下国家科技进步奖下一篇：法国紧急追加7万台订单！海尔空调稳居欧洲市场中企第一
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier adds R290 commercial heat pump - Cooling Post,www.coolingpost.com (Neil Everitt),2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-07 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.coolingpost.com/products/haier-adds-r290-commercial-heat-pump/,"Haier adds R290 commercial heat pump - Cooling Post ... # Haier adds R290 commercial heat pump ... ITALY: Haier is expanding its range of professional climate solutions with the launch of an R290 commercial air-to-water monobloc heat pump. ... The new R290 solution is available in capacities of 26, 30, 35 and 40kW, with the possibility to cascade up to eight units. ... It is fitted with a refrigerant leak detector, refrigerant separator alongside a fully sealed electrical control box. ... The commercial range maintains two-core wiring the same as the existing Haier residential heat pump range and has zone control. ... With energy efficiency ratings up to A+++ and SCOP values up to 4.91, the unit is capable of producing hot water temperatures of up to 80°C. ... The unit’s monobloc design, with the refrigeration circuit integrated into a single outdoor unit, simplifies installation by requiring only hydraulic connections on site. This reduces installation complexity and commissioning time, helping contractors and building owners deliver projects more efficiently. ... Designed with user comfort in mind, the system also offers quiet operation, with sound levels starting from 47dB(A), and includes zone control functionality to support more precise temperature management across different areas of a building."
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Energy Debuts At Intersolar With Home ESS,taiyangnews.info (Rajarshi Sengupta),2026-07-06T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-06 00:00:00+00:00,,https://taiyangnews.info/storage/haier-energy-home-ess-intersolar-europe-2026,"Haier Energy Debuts At Intersolar With Home ESS ... # Haier Energy Debuts At Intersolar With Home ESS ... The home appliance maker, which expanded into ESS manufacturing, unveiled its tower-like modular ESS platform offering multi-energy source compatibility to users ... Haier Energy’s stall showcased models of the E-Tower Ultra series ‘All-In-One’ residential ESS at the show. (Photo Credit: TaiyangNews) ... Jul 06, 2026, 10:07 am ... Haier Energy launched its E-Tower Ultra series residential ESS at the show ... This ESS has 3.6-12 kW/8-64 kWh single-phase, and 8-20 kW/8-64 kWh 3-phase variants ... These are scheduled to be commercially available by Q3 or at the start of Q4 2026 ... Haier Energy, a home appliance-turned energy storage system (ESS) provider, showcased its latest product, E-Tower Ultra, at Intersolar Europe 2026 for Europe’s residential prosumers, who are facing rising electricity costs and energy price volatility. ... This product, either with a single- or 3-phase hybrid inverter, can be mounted on top of 8 modular battery packs (each of 314 Ah and 8 kWh capacity) in a cable-free tower configuration for simplified installation and commissioning. The former, with an inverter capacity range of 3.6 to 12 kW, can connect to storage capacities between 8 and 64 kWh. In contrast, the 3-phase variant offers an 8-20 kW/8-64 kWh ESS. ... Both variants are designed to carry up to 200% DC/AC overcapacity compared to the rated full-load power output (AC) to maximize solar harvesting. In addition to the PV contribution, its integrated energy management system is embedded with AI algorithms that analyses dynamic electricity tariffs with prosumer or consumer load patterns, as per the company. ... Based on this analysis and the algorithm’s intelligence, battery charging and discharging scheduling can be adjusted to tariff slots with low and high rates, respectively. As a result, it explained, this helps users optimize grid power consumption, maximize PV self-consumption, and reduce electricity bills. ... The company’s HEvision platform, when integrated with its EMS, can also perform real-time weather forecasting. Meanwhile, in the event of a grid outage, this system switches to off-grid mode within 0 ms and provides emergency backup support for the continued operation of household loads. The system also supports integration with a diesel generator (DG) and a bidirectional EV charger via an external gateway for extended backup support, added Haier. ... This showcased product is expected to be commercially available by Q3 or at the start of Q4 2026. ... Intersolar Europe 2026"
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Energy Debuts at ASEW 2026 with Full-Scenario Energy Solutions,english.kyodonews.net,2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-03 00:00:00+00:00,,https://english.kyodonews.net/articles/-/79442,"Haier Energy Debuts at ASEW 2026 with Full-Scenario Energy Solutions ... # Haier Energy Debuts at ASEW 2026 with Full-Scenario Energy Solutions By Haier Energy, Dist.by K.K.Kyodo News - Jul 03, 2026 - 11:45 Release ... BANGKOK, July 3, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- The 22nd ASEAN Sustainable Energy Week (ASEW 2026), one of Southeast Asia's largest energy industry events, has concluded in Bangkok. Haier Energy debuted at the expo, showcasing its full-scenario smart energy solutions for residential, commercial and industrial (C&I), balcony, and portable use. During the event, Haier Energy signed strategic cooperation agreements with more than a dozen regional partners, underscoring its robust localized capabilities and expanding ecosystem across Southeast Asia. ... The ASEW debut marks Haier Energy's first major trade exhibition in Southeast Asia and establishes the brand's presence in the region's energy sector. Visiting the company's booth at the exhibition were Dr. Veerapat Kiatfuengfoo, Deputy Permanent Secretary of Thailand's Ministry of Energy, and Dr. Yutthaphong Thapphadu, Director of the Customer Relationship Management Department at Thailand's Provincial Electricity Authority (PEA). ... Driven by supportive regional policies, rising energy costs, and accelerating decarbonization efforts, Southeast Asia's renewable energy market is experiencing rapid growth. Across the region, households and businesses are seeking safe, reliable, cost-effective, and flexible clean energy solutions to reduce reliance on conventional power resources. ... To meet these evolving needs, Haier Energy showcased its full-scenario smart energy solutions which has been deployed in several landmark projects across Thailand, including premium residential communities and international schools. Backed by extensive project experience and a strong local reputation, the company has been certified as a New Energy Demonstration Enterprise by Thailand's Urban Planning and Environmental Protection Association, reaffirming its leadership in advancing the country's green energy transition. ... Haier Energy's proven delivery capabilities and comprehensive compliance credentials have also earned the trust of a growing ecosystem of partners. At the expo, Haier Energy signed strategic cooperation agreements with business partners across commercial real estate, green mobility, retail and infrastructure, covering project development, distribution, and after-sales service across the region. ... Centered in Thailand, Haier Energy has expanded its reach to Malaysia, Indonesia, Vietnam and other Southeast Asian markets, with local teams covering marketing, technical support, operation and maintenance (O&M), finance and supply chains. The company has built dedicated after-sales and O&M teams in each market, providing system monitoring, maintenance scheduling, and warranty support directly to end users. ... Local teams provide site surveys, system design and after-sales maintenance, with dedicated marketing and training support for partners. Haier Group's local manufacturing base supports efficient product delivery and stable supply across the region. Additionally, installment financing with ICBC Leasing Thailand and Bank of Ayudhya is available to partners. ... Haier Energy plans to expand its regional capabilities and product range across Southeast Asia, with the aim of bringing green energy solutions to more households and businesses as the region accelerates its transition away from conventional power."
HAIER,,,,Exa,新兴市场提速，欧美提效！海尔智家全球化能力持续见效-海尔官网,www.haier.com,2026-07-02T00:00:00.000Z,2026-07-02 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/about_haier/xinwen/20260714_293157.shtml,事实上，中国空调在欧洲市场的引爆，是中国家电企业厚积薄发的结果。如最早出海自主创牌的海尔智家，经过多年本土化布局，已实现欧洲暖通整体中企第一，并拿下欧洲多国第一。具体包括西班牙自有品牌销量销额双第一，成为过去6年内行业唯一份额（年累）超两位数品牌；意大利专业渠道第一，中国自主品牌第一；波兰市场份额排名第二位，一托多空调居第一位；英国6月份同比增幅近140%；德国6月份同比增幅133%。 ... 6月25日，国联民生证券还发布了海尔智家深度调研报告。研报指出，海尔智家依托新兴市场提速以及欧美提效，全球化能力持续见效，值得被长期看好。 ... 目前，海尔智家正在加速开拓新兴市场，打造海外增长新引擎。研报指出，2019-2025六年间，海尔智家在南亚、东南亚及中东非在内的新兴市场已实现了13%的复合增速。 ... 在刚结束不久的股东会上，海尔智家董事长兼总裁李华刚还透露了新兴市场的最新成果。目前，海尔智家在南亚市场收入增长15%以上、东南亚增长10%以上，两个市场分别位居行业前三和第一。同时，海尔智家也在加速布局中东非、拉美等潜力市场，培育新的增长点。今年2月，海尔智家在南非举办了品牌与新品发布会，计划用三年时间做到当地行业前三；5月，海尔智家在巴西召开了品牌与新品上市发布会，计划用5年时间进入当地行业前三。 ... 那么，海尔智家为何能在新兴市场提速发展？这背后离不开其构建全球一体化能力见效。海尔智家已实现实现从“品牌全球化”到“能力全球化”升级。如在研发能力上，海尔智家与用户共创的“懒人三筒洗衣机”已进入了全球27个国家和地区，其中针对越南湿热的气候，增加了留香洗功能，上市第一个月就把当地高端份额从0拉到了13%；在制造能力上，今年5月，海尔智家在泰国罗勇工业园正式奠基了全球首座中央空调AI智能体工厂，建成后将成为东南亚规模最大的中央空调智造基地。 ... 如果说新兴市场的关键词是“提速”，那么欧美市场的关键词则是“提效”。研报指出海尔欧洲此前一系列重组整合的红利正逐步释放，中期经营利润率有望提升至3%-5%，这能为海外利润带来8%以上的增长空间。而北美业务在极端天气、关税等短期扰动消退后，经营基本面也逐步企稳向上。 ... 这背后也是海尔智家全球化能力见效的直接体现。海尔智家通过“以本土化推进全球化，以全球化服务全球化”，可以更好地实现全球资源的协同。如在产品创新上，针对欧洲用户节能需求，海尔智家全球共创全球最节能的X11洗衣机，系统设计是在中国，技术模块是在美国，驱动系统是在新西兰，算法工程是在德国等，目前已在全球20多国成功上市，单型号销量突破80万台。在供应链协同上，今年4月海尔智家的泰国冰箱工厂已经实现100%承接了对美国大冰箱的出口，欧洲区域则通过供应链重塑使本土市场的订单响应速度提升了30%。 ... 随着全球化布局持续深化、运营能力持续落地，海尔智家的海外发展潜力将进一步释放，长期投资与成长价值持续凸显。
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Says It Is Now No. 2 in Japan Washers as Japanese Makers Exit White Goods,"www.techtimes.com (Allen Lee Published: Jun 25 2026, 1:07 PM EDT)",2026-06-25T00:00:00.000Z,2026-06-25 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.techtimes.com/articles/319002/20260625/haier-says-it-now-no-2-japan-washers-japanese-makers-exit-white-goods.htm,"Haier Says It Is Now No. 2 in Japan Washers as Japanese Makers Exit White Goods ... # Haier Says It Is Now No. 2 in Japan Washers as Japanese Makers Exit White Goods ... #### Haier paired ex-Sanyo brand AQUA with a budget line to fill the space Japanese makers left. By Allen Lee Published: Jun 25 2026, 1:07 PM EDT This photo taken on March 19, 2014 shows a customer (L) speaking to a salesclerk (2nd L-in blue vest) as he checks out household electrical appliances shop in Tokyo. TORU YAMANAKA/AFP via Getty Images China's Haier is expanding in Japan's appliance market, where it says it overtook Panasonic to reach second place in washing machines last year — a shift that, as reported by ETNews, has some Korean industry watchers warning their own companies could be next if they treat low-margin ""white goods"" as expendable. ... The story is less about cheap imports than about a patient strategy walking through a door Japanese makers chose to leave open. As Japan's electronics giants stepped back from low-margin home appliances to concentrate on higher-value businesses, Haier moved into the vacant space — and it did so with a playbook worth understanding on its own terms. ... In its fiscal 2025 annual report, Haier said the combined share of its own brand and AQUA reached 17.7% of Japan's washing-machine market, good for second place. That figure is Haier's own, drawn from its annual report; independent import data points the same direction, with Chinese-made washers accounting for the overwhelming majority of Japan's washing-machine imports. Haier also says its combined Haier-plus-AQUA share ranks first in Japan's refrigeration category, and it touts a leading combined position across refrigerators, freezers, and washers. Panasonic, for its part, had already slipped from first place in washers to second in 2023, before Haier's claimed overtaking. ... AQUA is the former Sanyo white-goods brand, which Haier acquired in 2012. The strategy pairs a premium AQUA line — trading on Sanyo's half-century of washer engineering and the trust Japanese buyers still place in the name — with Haier's own mid-to-low-priced brand beneath it. That lets one company occupy both the premium and budget shelves under names local consumers already accept, rather than fighting uphill as a foreign newcomer. It is the same localization playbook Haier used in the U.S. by buying GE Appliances in 2016 and keeping the American name. Framed plainly, this is a legitimate competitive achievement: smart acquisitions, local brand-building, and pricing discipline, not a mystery. ... Haier's advance owes much to Japanese makers retreating from white goods — and that retreat was a choice, not a defeat. Hitachi, long a washing-machine leader, has weighed selling its home-appliance business since last year and spun off its consumer-electronics arm in April, with its parent focusing on air conditioning. Across the Japanese electronics industry, the pattern has been an active contraction: stepping back from low-margin, fiercely competitive downstream products to concentrate capital on higher-value components and businesses. Exiting a commodity-hardware category where you compete mainly on price can be a perfectly rational decision. ... ense, which absorbed ... , and together with TCL — pushing large ... -priced sets — ... The deeper debate the Japanese case has stirred among Korean industry voices is about what a low-margin appliance is actually worth. Their argument: a refrigerator, washer, or air conditioner is not just a one-time hardware sale but a physical node that sits in a home for a decade, and increasingly a connected one — a consumer touchpoint and installed base underpinning smart-home platforms, service networks, and component supply chains. On this view, ceding the ""boring"" box today could undercut tomorrow's higher-margin AI-appliance, subscription, and home-energy businesses, because those are built on the foothold the hardware provides. ""The changes in Japan's appliance market are a case study in what happens the moment you lose the manufacturing touchpoint,"" one industry insider said. ... That is a strategic argument, and a contested one. The counter-consideration is the very logic behind the Japanese exits: if a hardware category is genuinely unprofitable, defending it for the sake of a future platform may cost more than it returns, and focusing on components or services can be the sounder bet. Notably, Korean firms are not standing still either — LG has moved to re-enter Japan's premium appliance market after a roughly 12-year absence, with AI-equipped washers, suggesting the ""touchpoint"" thesis is one some are choosing to act on. ... According to Haier's own fiscal 2025 annual report, the combined market share of its Haier and AQUA brands reached 17.7% of Japan's washing-machine market last year, which it says put it in second place ahead of Panasonic. That figure is self-reported by Haier, so it should be read as the company's claim, though it is consistent with broader trade data showing Chinese-made washers dominate Japan's washing-machine imports. Rankings can differ depending on whether they measure individual brands, combined brand families, or import value. ... AQUA is a Japanese home-appliance brand that originated from Sanyo's white-goods business. When Haier acquired Sanyo's washing-machine and refrigerator operations in 2012, it gained the AQUA name and Sanyo's decades of appliance engineering. Haier now positions AQUA as a premium line in Japan — leveraging the local trust and heritage attached to the former Sanyo products — while selling its own Haier-branded appliances at lower price points, covering multiple tiers of the market under familiar names. ... Japanese electronics companies have increasingly stepped back from low-margin ""white goods"" like washers and refrigerators to focus on higher-value businesses, a trend rooted in decades of price competition, higher domestic costs, and the loss of cost advantage in commodity hardware and display panels. Hitachi, for example, has weighed selling its home-appliance business and spun off its consumer-electronics arm, with its parent emphasizing air conditioning. Industry analysts often describe this as a strategic choice to retreat upstream toward components and services rather than a simple failure. ... Chinese brands surpassed half of Japan's flat-panel TV market for the first time in 2024, according to data from research firm BCN reported by Nikkei. Hisense — which acquired Toshiba's TV business and operates the REGZA brand through TVS REGZA — led the market, and together with its own brand and TCL, Chinese companies overtook Japanese incumbents Sony and Panasonic, each of which fell below 10% share. The gains were driven largely by competitive pricing and demand among younger consumers, alongside Japanese makers' own decisions to scale back their TV operations."
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Returns to IFA 2026 With a Vision of “Intelligent Possibilities” – WHITEGOODSNOW,whitegoodsnow.com (whitegoodsnow),2026-06-25T00:00:00.000Z,2026-06-25 00:00:00+00:00,,https://whitegoodsnow.com/2026/06/25/haier-returns-to-ifa-2026-with-a-vision-of-intelligent-possibilities/,"Haier Returns to IFA 2026 With a Vision of “Intelligent Possibilities” – WHITEGOODSNOW ... Haier Confirms Return to IFA 2026 With AI‑Driven Home Vision ... Haier Europe will return to IFA 2026 with its new theme, “Home of Intelligent Possibilities,” showcasing AI‑powered appliances and connected home ecosystems across its Haier, Candy and Hoover brands. ... The company will highlight advances in adaptive washing, cooling, cooking and home care, alongside live demos, expert talks and showcooking sessions. Haier will also spotlight its global sports partnerships, reinforcing its premium brand positioning. ... Haier’s message for 2026 is clear: the next phase of home appliances is built on AI, seamless connectivity and user‑centred design."
HAIER,,,,Exa,跑赢行业！海尔智家全球三大市场持续提升竞争力-海尔官网,www.haier.com,2026-06-24T00:00:00.000Z,2026-06-24 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/about_haier/xinwen/20260625_292330.shtml,跑赢行业！海 ... 智家全球三大市场持续提升竞争力-海尔官网 ... 首页> 关于海尔 >品牌资讯> 跑赢行业！海尔智家全球三大市场持续提升竞争力 ... # 跑赢行业！海尔智家全球三大市场持续提升竞争力 ... 6月24日，海尔智家2025年年度股东会暨2026年第一次A股/D股/H股类别股东会在青岛召开。现场，海尔智家董事长兼总裁李华刚表示，海尔智家在北美、中国、欧洲三大核心市场均跑赢行业，竞争力也在持续提升。 ... 当前，企业面临的外部环境是什么样的？全球三大核心市场同步承压，行业普遍面临需求疲软、成本上行、汇率波动等挑战。在北美市场，去年关税同比大幅上涨，全行业成本高企，市场竞争依然激烈；在中国市场，今年一季度下滑6.2%，二季度的压力仍然存在，需求复苏节奏弱于预期；在欧洲市场，受红海冲突拖累，海运费大涨，传统大家电消费需求整体疲软。 ... 那么，海尔智家在美中欧三个市场表现如何呢？在这样的背景下，海尔智家在全球核心市场的表现均跑赢行业。在北美市场，海尔智家旗下GE Appliances在同行业中表现最好，价格指数持续提升，市场份额持续稳居第一。海尔智家董事、副总裁Kevin Nolan现场表示:“今年是GE Appliances加入海尔大家庭的十周年，目前是美国市场排名第一的家电公司。在此过程中，我们强化了供应链、制造能力、产品组合、商业执行力以及消费者体验。我们预期将持续提升份额、扩大盈利能力。”在欧洲市场，海尔智家已跻身行业前三，2026年以来冰箱、洗衣机的销量份额分别提升了1.1个和0.4个百分点。在中国市场，海尔智家白电业务线上、线下份额继续保持双第一，分别同比提升3.1个和1.4个百分点，龙头地位稳固。 ... 取得亮眼成果的背后，是海尔智家通过全方位变革，构建起多重抗风险壁垒。首先，针对关税冲击，海尔智家加速重构全球供应链。像在北美，海尔泰国冰箱工厂实现100%承接了对美国大冰箱出口；同时在美国启动了洗衣机、热水器等产品制造基地建设。这些项目落地后，海尔智家在北美的成本竞争力进一步凸显。 ... 其次，海尔智家深入推进全流程数字化+AI变革，不断提升企业运营效率，实现费率持续优化。以超级智能体“智小能”为统一入口，海尔智家打通了从研发到服务的全链路，重构每个环节的决策与执行模式，直接转化为运营提效与成本优化。 ... 再次，面对国内市场，海尔智家推进全域TC变革，实现从需求到交付全链路提效。这样的变革也取得了成效：在刚结束的618大促中，海尔智家线上全渠道核心品类销量全部位列第一。 ... 最后，面对海外市场，海尔智家构建全球一体化能力，实现从“品牌全球化”到“能力全球化”升级。未来，海尔智家海外收入要占公司整体收入的三分之二，其中非美市场收入要占到海外收入的三分之二，真正实现全球化均衡发展。 ... 立足AI时代，海尔智家规划了三条清晰的增长曲线。一是做厚第一曲线，深耕智慧家庭基本盘；二是做宽第二曲线，拓宽住居生态新边界；三是做远第三曲线，聚焦家庭机器人等AI赛道，锚定时代红利、蓄力长期增长。 ... 短期承压是事实，长期竞争力的持续提升也有迹可循。随着全球供应链重构、数字化变革和新兴市场布局等举措逐步落地，海尔智家能否在行业调整期中继续兑现增长预期，值得关注。
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Thailand Makes MIIT Overseas Smart Factory List - Haier Group Official Website,www.haier.com,2026-06-16T00:00:00.000Z,2026-06-16 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/global/press-events/news/20260616_291881.shtml,"Haier Thailand Makes MIIT Overseas Smart Factory List - Haier Group Official Website ... Home Page Media Center News Release Haier Thailand Makes MIIT Overseas Smart Factory List ... Haier Thailand Makes MIIT Overseas Smart Factory List ... 6.06.03 ... On May 28, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT) released the first compilation of cases on overseas smart factories. Haier Air Conditioning’s Chonburi Park in Thailand was selected, emerging as the sole overseas manufacturing base in the white goods sector to receive this authoritative certification. The base sets a replicable and scalable global benchmark for Chinese manufacturing standards going global. ... The selection for MIIT’s first batch of overseas smart factory cases follows extremely stringent criteria. From planning to commissioning, Haier’s Chonburi Park in Thailand has been built against world-leading benchmarks. As Haier’s first overseas digital twin interconnected smart factory, the site covers roughly 324,000 square metres with a designed annual capacity of six million sets. Put into operation in September 2025, it ranks as Thailand’s most intelligent and largest manufacturing base for air conditioner production. The park has deployed 23 digital systems across 13 core fields to realise end-to-end connectivity covering order processing, production and supply chain management, lifting order delivery efficiency by 50% and overall production efficiency by 35%, achieving full capacity right after launch. ... The park integrates AI and digital technologies into the full workflow of R&D, production, quality inspection and equipment management. Powered by AI applications, its R&D cycle is cut by 30%, while automation of core working procedures hits 45%. AI-powered visual inspection and acoustic noise detection are deployed across all production lines. Every step from customer order placement to finished product delivery is digitally visible, controllable and traceable, enabling finished products to meet global market access requirements. ... Beyond smart manufacturing, the park advances green development in parallel. It pioneers the overseas application of vacuum degreasing eco-friendly technology and installs a distributed photovoltaic system generating nearly 9 MWh of clean power annually, eliminating over 10,000 tonnes of carbon dioxide emissions each year. The facility has obtained Thailand’s highest-tier A2+ certification from BOI, building a benchmark for sustainable overseas manufacturing via clean energy and eco-friendly processes. Its proven smart manufacturing model can be rolled out across full product lines including refrigerators, washing machines and kitchen appliances, driving the shift of global manufacturing toward intelligence, high efficiency and low carbon. ... Its inclusion in MIIT’s first overseas smart factory case compilation marks a key milestone in Haier Smart Home’s globalisation and demonstrates the fruitful global expansion of China’s home appliance manufacturing industry. Going forward, Haier Smart Home will keep upgrading its worldwide manufacturing footprint with digital and low-carbon technologies, building more benchmark projects featuring Chinese smart manufacturing and supporting high-quality global expansion for Chinese enterprises. ... Prev：Haier becomes Major Partner of the Royal Moroccan Football Federation Next：Haier Confirms Official Partner of Roland-Garros 2026, Bringing Care-Driven Innovation to Audiences Worldwide"
HAIER,,,,Exa,海尔“三变”：从家电巨头到科技生态企业的跃迁 - 海尔集团官网,www.haier.com,2026-06-09T00:00:00.000Z,2026-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/press-events/news/20260609_291701.shtml,“三变”：从家电巨头到科技生态企业的跃迁 - 海尔集团官网 海尔“三变”：从家电巨头到科技生态企业的跃迁 2026.06.09 ... 2025年，海尔集团旗下的子公司海尔智家营收突破3000亿元大关，达3023.47亿元，归母净利润195.53亿元，双双创下历史新高。同年，海尔集团全球营收达4268亿元，利润总额超300亿元。在这份亮眼的成绩单背后，一系列深刻的结构性变革正在悄然重塑这家走过四十余年的中国企业——不只是在财报数字上，更在思维模式、产品形态与产业边界三个维度，海尔正迎来一场前所未有的“变化”。 ... 一个最生动的例子是“懒人三筒洗衣机”。有网友在海尔评论区喊话，想要一台能同时分开洗涤衣物的一体式洗衣机。其时，海尔已经在与用户交互之后，在 ... 如果说思维之变是软性变革，产品之变则是硬核实力的集中体现。以海尔智家为例，2025年，海尔智家研发投入达107.17亿元，占营收比重3.54%，研发人员超2.5万人。这组数字背后，是一场以AI重新定义“家”和“智慧生活”的深刻革命。 ... 2026年3月，海尔在中国家电及消费电子博览会上正式展示了“家庭具身智能”的完整图景。在海尔智慧家庭的战略构想中，未来家庭智能的核心不应是孤立的设备，而是拥有完整生命形态的“家庭空间”。依托Uhome大模型，海尔正在推动从产品智能向场景智能升级——冰箱可以识别食材并推荐菜谱，空调“只吹风不吹人”，智能挂烫机能根据衣物面料自动调节温度和蒸汽量。 ... 最引人注目的是海尔在AWE上发布的三款“海娃”家庭机器人：主动打扫卫生的清洁机器人、能提醒老人服药并处理摔倒的陪伴机器人、擅长联动各类家电包办家务的家务机器人。“无人家务”从理想一步步走向现实。 ... 不止于家电制造，海尔在大健康、数字经济、新能源领域不断迭代创新，产业边界持续拓宽，发展触角向更多新兴、未来领域深度延伸。 ... 2026年2月，海尔正式发布了目前正在加速布局的智慧家庭、大健康、数字经济、汽车、机器人、新能源六大产业生态布局。 ... 这六大生态不是简单的“多元化扩张”，而是海尔聚焦实业，以其产业技术积累、供应链能力和用户运营能力为底座，进行跨行业、跨场景的系统性赋能。周云杰将2026年的战略主线概括为“生态协同、用户链接、全球纵深”三大关键词。 ... 2025年8月，海尔旗下的卡泰驰战略入股汽车之家。在外界看来，这似乎是“家电巨头跨界玩车”，但内行看到的是一张通往万亿级汽车后市场的生态战略布局。在这一布局中，卡泰驰主攻线下连锁服务与交付，汽车之家负责线上流量与内容，二者协同补足了线上线下全流程的生态闭环。 ... 汽车之家并非“财务投资”意义上的收购标的——即便在行业整体承压的2025年，其全年总营收仍达64.52亿元，归母净利润14.43亿元，基本面稳健。更重要的是，汽车之家的价值在于其深耕二十余年积累的5.03亿月活跃用户和海量数据资产。在AI的加持下，汽车之家已基于DeepSeek和自主研发的大模型推出AI智能助手，为海尔实现“人—车—家”的跨场景数据打通和体验融合提供了核心支点。 ... 机器人生态被海尔定位为支撑整个生态体系的重要基础设施与赋能引擎。2025年，海尔完成对A股上市公司新时达的战略收购。新时达在工业自动化与机器人领域拥有深厚积累，自海尔入股以来加速从工业自动化向工业智能化跃迁。 ... 2025年12月，新时达发布工规级轮式人形机器人SYNDA R1，面向真实工业场景设计，可在复杂环境中完成巡检、物料搬运及质检等任务。新时达还推出了面向人形机器人的关节模组产品，采用全栈自研架构，在高扭矩与轻量化之间实现了平衡。目前，新时达已构建起协作机器人、移动复合机器人、轮式人形机器人以及双足人形机器人四大具身产品矩阵。 ... 从智慧家庭场景的“海娃”家用机器人，到工业场景的SYNDA R1人形机器人，海尔在“机器人”赛道上的布局覆盖了从C端到B端的全场景，形成了一条完整的价值链。 ... 六大生态布局的背后，是海尔全球化战略的持续深化。当下，全球化已经从“战略选项”变成了“生存必须”，作为全球创牌的“优等生”之一，海尔追求的并不是简单的产品出海。 ... 依托智慧家庭、大健康、数字经济、机器人、新能源、汽车六大产业生态，海尔正从产品输出迈向生态全球化的纵深阶段。智慧家庭为基，在全球落地全场景解决方案，筑牢用户基本盘。数字经济生态以卡奥斯工业互联网平台为支点，向全球输出智能制造与数字化转型能力，赋能当地产业升级。大健康、机器人、新能源、汽车四大新生态则精准切入全球新兴赛道，通过技术协同与本土化布局，开辟增量空间。 ... 六大生态相互赋能，形成完善的全球本土化体系，推动海尔从家电巨头进化为全球化科技生态领航者，实现质变。 ... 产业层面，从“家电制造”到“智慧家庭”，再到覆盖智慧家庭、大健康、数字经济、汽车、机器人、新能源六大生态的跨行业平台。海尔的生态边界已经从厨房、客厅延伸到了新兴产业和未来产业。 ... 在“生态协同”上，六大产业生态正在从“各自为战”走向“One Haier”的有机融合。跨生态协同的核心，不仅是场景的打通，更是数据、算法和用户体验的贯通。 ... 在“全球纵深”上，海尔的目标是从“全球覆盖”转向“本土深耕”。未来，海尔将在全球各主要市场实现更深层次的本土化运营，包括研发、制造、品牌和人才的全方位本土化。 ... 海尔正在从“家电制造商”向“硬科技公司”转型，这已经成为不争的事实。2025年，海尔智家107亿元的研发投入、2.5万人的研发团队，只是一个侧影。更具象征意义的是海尔在机器人（新时达）、具身智能（SYNDA R1人形机器人）、AI大模型（智家大脑与Uhome大模型）等前沿科技领域的深度布局。 ... 在基础科学研究方面，海尔也在加大投入。周云杰表示，海尔将开展“AI穿透行动”，全面实施科技领先战略。未来5年研发投入累计不少于1000亿元，重点投向人工智能、芯片、物联网安全等基础技术领域，筑牢AI原生的技术根基。 ... 智慧家庭生态，是生命体的“心脏”与“主战场”，大健康与汽车产业生态，是“未来之翼”，数字经济、机器人、新能源生态，则是“基础设施和赋能引擎”。 ... 张瑞敏常说，在物联网时代，“产品会被场景替代，行业将被生态‘复’盖”。当海尔从一家卖冰箱、洗衣机的家电厂商，蜕变为一个横跨六大生态、以AI和具身智能为核心能力、在全球范围构建产业生态的科技企业，唯一不变的是它始终在“变”这一事实本身。 ... 海尔的“三变”故事，还远未结束——2026年6月3日，在第八届全国青年企业家大会上，张瑞敏结合海尔四十多年的发展历程，分享了三点经营感悟以及它们之间的逻辑关系。他说，网络化时代的企业就要拆掉围墙，成为亚马逊雨林式的可自我进化的生态。显然，当下的海尔，早已拆掉围墙，而亚马逊雨林，正在这个不断自我进化的生态中，由无数创客和用户共同成就。
HAIER,,,,Exa,Caryle acquires water purifier maker Chung Ho Nais - The Korea Herald,www.koreaherald.com (Im Eun-byel),2026-06-08T00:00:00.000Z,2026-06-08 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.koreaherald.com/article/10766054,"Caryle acquires water purifier maker Chung Ho Nais - The Korea Herald ... # Caryle acquires water purifier maker Chung Ho Nais ... US private equity giant Carlyle said Monday it has signed a stock purchase agreement to acquire Chung Ho Group, which owns Korean home and healthcare appliance rental platform Chung Ho Nais. ... While the companies did not disclose financial terms, industry sources estimate the transaction is worth just over 1 trillion won ($644 million). ... The acquisition covers a 100 percent stake in Chung Ho Nais and its affiliates, including Microfilter, a water purifier filter manufacturer, and MCM, a parts supplier. The group's combined annual revenue exceeds 700 billion won. ... The transaction is expected to close in the third quarter of 2026, subject to regulatory approvals and customary closing conditions. ... Sources said the sale is partly aimed at securing funds for inheritance tax payments estimated at nearly 300 billion won. Joung directly owned a 75.1 percent stake in Chung Ho Nais and controlled an additional 13 percent through Microfilter, where he held an 80 percent stake. ... Under Carlyle's ownership, Chung Ho Nais is expected to pursue a new growth strategy focused on expanding its product lineup, including direct-flow water purifiers, and increasing its presence in overseas markets. ... ""We believe Chung Ho is one of Korea's leading water purifier and home appliance companies, supported by strong technological and operational capabilities,"" said John Kim, chairman of Korea for Carlyle Asia Partners. ... ""We are excited about the opportunity to partner with Chung Ho and leverage Carlyle's global network and experience to strengthen its market position and support its next phase of growth."""
HAIER,,,,Exa,"Haier Celebrates One Year of Lumiere 4-Door Side-by-Side Refrigerators in India; Surpasses 50,000 Happy Customers and Introduces Special Anniversary Color Editions | Business News This Week",businessnewsthisweek.com (Neel Achary),2026-06-04T00:00:00.000Z,2026-06-04 00:00:00+00:00,,https://businessnewsthisweek.com/business/haier-celebrates-one-year-of-lumiere-4-door-side-by-side-refrigerators-in-india-surpasses-50000-happy-customers-and-introduces-special-anniversary-color-editions/,"Haier Celebrates One Year of Lumiere 4-Door Side-by-Side Refrigerators in India; Surpasses 50,000 Happy Customers and Introduces Special Anniversary Color Editions | Business News This Week ... India, June 04: Haier Appliances India, the No.1 global major appliances brand for 17 consecutive years, marks a landmark first anniversary for its Lumiere 4–Door Side–by–Side refrigerator range in India, underscoring its growing footprint in the premium refrigeration segment. To celebrate the occasion, the brand unveils a special anniversary edition in a Rosette White, Pearl White, Mauve Pink finishes, adding a fresh, design-led expression to the Lumiere range. Designed to complement the evolving aesthetics of modern Indian homes, this new color adds a refined and sophisticated touch, transforming the refrigerators from a functional appliance into an elegant lifestyle statement. ... Since its launch in 2025, the Lumiere Series has witnessed an overwhelmingly positive consumer response across the country, achieving over 50,000 installations in Indian homes. The premium Lumiere range combines intelligent storage, advanced cooling technology and premium aesthetics. This milestone reinforces Haier’s continued commitment to innovating for Indian consumers under its “Made in India, Made for India” philosophy, while strengthening its leadership in the premium multi-door refrigerator segment. As part of the anniversary celebrations, Haier is also offering a 5-year comprehensive warranty on all its 3-door and 4–door Side By Side models for a limited period. ... Together, these innovations reflect Haier’s focus on bringing global technology leadership to Indian consumers through locally relevant innovation. ... Speaking on the occasion, Mr. NS Satish, CEO, Haier Appliances India, said, “At Haier Appliances India, our approach to innovation has always been driven by a deep understanding of evolving consumer lifestyles. The Haier Lumiere 4–Door Side–by–Side refrigerator range was designed to redefine premium refrigeration by bringing together intelligent storage, smart technology and sophisticated design for modern Indian homes. Completing one year with over 50,000 happy customers is a strong validation of this vision and reflects the growing shift towards multi-door, flexible refrigeration solutions in India. To mark this occasion, we are introducing a new anniversary edition in a Satin White Glass finish, further strengthening the design appeal of the Lumiere range. As the market continues to evolve, we remain committed to our ‘Made in India, Made for India’ philosophy and introducing next-generation appliances that not only meet consumer needs but also shape the future of connected and intelligent living.” ... Over the past year, the series has gained strong traction among consumers upgrading from conventional double-door and standard side–by–side refrigerators to multi-door premium refrigeration solutions. ... ’s Premium Appliance ... The strong consumer adoption of the Lumiere range over the past year highlights the growing demand for premium, technology-driven home appliances in India. ... By combining design excellence, smart connectivity, and intelligent storage innovation, the Lumiere series has played an important role in expanding Haier’s footprint in the premium multi-door refrigerator category. ... As the company continues to deepen its commitment to the Indian market, Haier aims to further strengthen its portfolio of locally manufactured, consumer-inspired appliances that address the evolving needs of modern households."
HAIER,,,,Exa,"Haier Introduces Horizon Refrigerator to Vietnam, Revolutionizing Food Freshness Standards - Third News",third-news.com,2026-06-03T00:00:00.000Z,2026-06-03 00:00:00+00:00,,https://third-news.com/article/0bd7d850-5f97-11f1-9776-9ca3ba08e13f,"Haier Introduces Horizon Refrigerator to Vietnam, Revolutionizing Food Freshness Standards - Third News ... # Haier Introduces Horizon Refrigerator to Vietnam, Revolutionizing Food Freshness Standards ... ## Haier Introduces Horizon Refrigerator in Vietnam ... Haier has made a significant leap into the Southeast Asian market by launching its highly anticipated Horizon refrigerator in Vietnam. This introduction marks the company's entry into a region where there is a booming demand for advanced and versatile solutions in food preservation. The Horizon refrigerator was unveiled on May 29, representing a premium addition to Haier's product lineup, which has already garnered recognition in Europe and beyond. ... The Horizon refrigerator is specifically designed with the unique challenges of tropical climates in mind, allowing consumers to enjoy ice-cold beverages and various fresh ingredients. Equipped with Haier's cutting-edge HCS humidity control system and magnetic freshness technology, this refrigerator maintains food quality by ensuring that fruits and vegetables stay fresh for up to seven days, while fresh meat can retain its original flavor for as long as ten days without loss of proteins. Notably, Haier's proprietary technology has earned accolades, including a gold medal at the International Exhibition of Inventions in Geneva. Additionally, it's certified by VDE to preserve more than 95% of proteins in meat, showcasing the appliance's superior food storage capabilities. ... ### Expansion Plans in Southeast Asia ... Vietnam has emerged as a strategic market for Haier, leading the premium refrigerator segment in Southeast Asia. The company has noted an impressive sales growth, with a doubling of sales in January 2026, translating to over a 60% increase year-on-year. Haier's presence in retail outlets allows customers to experience the superior food preservation technology firsthand. Within just five weeks, the Space Fit series matched competitors' sales figures that typically take eight months, achieving five times their revenue, and positioning Haier as a pioneer of intelligent home solutions in Vietnam. ... In furthering its market strength, Haier Smart Home has also officially launched its brand in Vietnam, establishing strategic partnerships with prominent local retailers like DMX. Their AQUA washing machines currently lead the market share, setting the stage for future growth. By April 2026, Haier had secured the top position in overall market share across Southeast Asia, with remarkable growth exceeding 40% in Vietnam, Malaysia, and other markets. Following its entry into Vietnam, the Horizon series will soon be available in Indonesia and Thailand, solidifying Haier's leading presence in the premium product segment across the region. Overall, the launch of the Horizon refrigerator represents a significant transformative shift for Haier, elevating its brand from a high-volume seller to a premium player in the Southeast Asian market. Going forward, Haier is committed to addressing user needs, fostering local innovations, and enhancing its brand image to strengthen its market leadership. Through continuous innovation in top-tier products and improved consumer experiences, Haier seeks to provide partners with exceptional food preservation quality, aesthetically pleasing kitchen designs, and sustainable growth."
HAIER,,,,Exa,"Haier Launches Horizon Refrigerator in Vietnam, Setting a New Standard for Freshness and Domestic Appliance Design - Third News",third-news.com,2026-06-02T00:00:00.000Z,2026-06-02 00:00:00+00:00,,https://third-news.com/article/06dcb7ea-5edd-11f1-bf80-9ca3ba08e13f,"Haier Launches Horizon Refrigerator in Vietnam, Setting a New Standard for Freshness and Domestic Appliance Design - Third News ... # Haier Launches Horizon Refrigerator in Vietnam, Setting a New Standard for Freshness and Domestic Appliance Design ... On June 3, 2026, Haier officially launched its Horizon Refrigerator series in Vietnam, marking a significant entry into the Southeast Asian market. This new line of refrigerators embodies more than just advanced technology; it aims to redefine freshness and design standards for home appliances in the region. The Horizon Collection was unveiled on May 29, initially introduced at the Royal Observatory in Greenwich, UK, before making its way across Europe. With its debut in Vietnam, Haier emphasizes its commitment to providing premium food preservation solutions tailored to local consumer needs. The launch aligns with the growing demand for versatile and sophisticated refrigeration solutions in hot and humid climates, where maintaining food freshness is paramount. To cater to these conditions, the Horizon Refrigerator incorporates innovative technologies that promise to keep fruits and vegetables fresh for up to 7 days and maintain the original flavor of fresh meat for as long as 10 days. This is made possible through the integration of Haier's first global humidity control technology (HCS) and magnetically controlled freshness features, which have been recognized with a gold medal at the International Invention Exhibition in Geneva and certified by VDE for preserving over 95% of protein in meats. Notably, the Horizon Refrigerator boasts a substantial capacity of 716 liters, with adjustable shelves and deep door compartments capable of accommodating larger items like 1.5-liter bottles. Select models also feature AI Vision technology, which automatically identifies and records food types and quantities, simplifying food management for users. At the same time, Haier presented its Space Fit series of home appliances, showcasing a refrigerator equipped with original AI technology that ensures a temperature fluctuation of only 1°C throughout. This feature guarantees that after thawing, steaks retain their tenderness, vibrant color, and juiciness without compromising on nutrients. Strategically, Vietnam is viewed as a critical hub for Haier's premium expansion throughout the region, accounting for over half of the Southeast Asian luxury refrigerator market. With remarkable sales growth, Haier's refrigerator sales doubled in January 2026 compared to the previous month and soared over 60% year on year, solidifying its market leadership in Vietnam. In retail establishments, customers can directly experience Haier's conservation technology through comparative demonstrations, and the Space Fit series has surpassed competitors' sales figures in record time. Haier aims to enhance its product offerings continually to meet the rising demand for food preservation solutions with its new flagship Horizon series. Following its brand entry into Vietnam in 2025, aligned with strategic partnerships with prominent local appliance retailers, Haier's AQUA washing machines have captured significant market share within the country. As of April 2026, Haier led the overall brand share in Southeast Asia, with impressive growth exceeding 40% across Vietnam, Malaysia, and other markets. Post-launch in Vietnam, the Horizon series plans to expand into Indonesia and Thailand, further solidifying Haier's reputation for premium products across the region. This rollout signifies a strategic shift for Haier in Southeast Asia, transitioning from a quantity-driven leader to a premium brand. The company is committed to deepening local innovations and enhancing brand modernization to maintain its market-leading position. Through ongoing cutting-edge innovations and tailored experiences, Haier aspires to deliver superior preservation solutions while achieving aesthetic kitchen designs and sustainable growth for its partners. For more details, visit Haier's official website. ####"
HAIER,,,,Exa,"Haier Launches Horizon Refrigerator in Vietnam, Setting New Standards for Freshness and Home Appliance Design",www.prnewswire.com (Haier Group),2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z,2026-06-01 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/haier-launches-horizon-refrigerator-in-vietnam-setting-new-standards-for-freshness-and-home-appliance-design-302786887.html,"Haier Launches Horizon Refrigerator in Vietnam, Setting New Standards for Freshness and Home Appliance Design Accessibility Statement Skip Navigation ... HO CHI MINH CITY, Vietnam, June 1, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- To meet Vietnamese consumers' demand for versatile, multi-scenario fresh-keeping solutions, Haier launches its premium Horizon Collection refrigerator series in Vietnam on May 29, marking the first stop in the Southeast Asian market. From its initial launch at the Royal Observatory, Greenwich in the UK to its full market rollout across Europe, and now the release in Vietnam, the Horizon series is rapidly accelerating its global footprint to bring a premium food freshness preservation experience to more consumers. ... In the meantime, Haier also showcased its Space Fit series home appliance solutions at the Horizon series launch event, the ... preservation technology, which keeps temperature fluctuations below ... °C. Even after a month of freezing, steak remains tender, red, and juicy when thawed, with no loss of nutrients. ... Vietnam, the strategic springboard for Haier's premium regional expansion ... Vietnam is Southeast Asia's largest high-end refrigerator market, accounting for over half of regional sales. In January 2026, Haier's refrigerator sales in Vietnam doubled month-to-month and rose by more than 60% year-on-year, further solidifying its position as the market leader in the region. At retail outlets, side-by-side demos let customers experience Haier's preservation technology. The Space Fit series matched competitors' eight-month in-store display numbers in just five weeks and achieved five times their sales, spearheading Vietnam's smart-home upgrade. ... Already leading in both market share and growth in Vietnam, Haier will further strengthen its product lineup to meet rising demand for food freshness preservation with the new global flagship Horizon series. ... Furthermore, Haier Smart Home officially launched the Haier brand in Vietnam in 2025 and reached a strategic partnership with the local leading appliance retailer DMX. Its AQUA washers already hold the country's top market share. ... As of April 2026, Haier ranks No. 1 in overall brand share across Southeast Asia, with growth exceeding 40% in Vietnam, Malaysia, and other markets. Following Vietnam, the Horizon series will roll out in Indonesia and Thailand, driving Haier's high-end leadership across the region. ... The launch of the Horizon series marks Haier's refrigerator segment's shift in Southeast Asia from leader in scale to a premium brand. Looking ahead, Haier will stay user-focused, deepen local innovation and brand upgrades to cement market leadership, and through ongoing high-end innovations and enhanced scenario-based experiences, Haier aims to deliver superior preservation, kitchen aesthetics, and sustainable growth for partners."
HAIER,,,,Exa,"Haier Biomedical Achieves Double No. 1 Ranking in Euromonitor's Global Life Science Lab Equipment Report, Caps Three-Phase Global Expansion",www.prnewswire.com (Haier Biomedical),2026-05-28T00:00:00.000Z,2026-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/haier-biomedical-achieves-double-no-1-ranking-in-euromonitors-global-life-science-lab-equipment-report-caps-three-phase-global-expansion-302784501.html,"Haier Biomedical Achieves Double No. 1 Ranking in Euromonitor's Global Life Science Lab Equipment Report, Caps Three-Phase Global Expansion Accessibility Statement Skip Navigation ... QINGDAO, China, May 28, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Haier Biomedical(SHA: 688139) has been named the No. 1 Chinese brand in global life science laboratory equipment sales and No. 1 in overseas sales in the same category, according to 2025 data published by Euromonitor International. The dual ranking places Haier Biomedical at the front of a competitive global field and caps a three-phase international expansion that has delivered a compound annual growth rate exceeding 20 percent. ... Haier Biomedical Achieves Double No. 1 Ranking in Euromonitor’s Global Life Science Lab Equipment Report, Caps Three-Phase Global Expansion ... Euromonitor International is one of the world's leading independent market research firms, and its rankings are widely used as benchmarks across global procurement and industry analysis. The two No. 1 positions cover total global sales revenue and overseas sales revenue measured among Chinese-owned brands in the life science laboratory equipment category. The rankings span all global markets, confirming that Haier Biomedical is competing at the highest level against established international manufacturers. ... The rankings also carry practical weight for international partners. In a field where equipment reliability, regulatory compliance, and long-term service support are critical to procurement decisions, independent verification of market leadership provides an additional layer of confidence for institutions evaluating suppliers. ... Haier Biomedical's international growth began with targeted projects, working directly with organizations including UNICEF and the WHO to solve specific unmet needs and building a leading position in solar-powered vaccine storage. From there, the company scaled its distribution network to cover 160 countries through more than 800 active dealer relationships. The current phase focuses on embedding full operational capabilities in key regions: local warehousing, sales, marketing, product planning, and R&D. ... The company now operates overseas R&D centers in the UK, Italy, and Japan, each focused on specific product lines including centrifuges, cold chain and automation storage solutions, incubators, and biosafety cabinets. In the UK and continental Europe, dedicated product specialists in automation and centrifuge technology provide on-site support for GMP compliance, air safety, and sample purification, positioning Haier Biomedical as a laboratory workflow partner. Service standards developed in the US and UK are being replicated across the EU, Southeast Asia, and South Asia. ... In Q1 2026, revenue in Germany, Australia, and Canada grew more than 50 percent, while Eastern Europe, South Asia, and Brazil each exceeded 100 percent year-on-year growth, with centrifuges and incubators both doubling in volume. In the pharmaceutical sector, Haier Biomedical is part of the supply chains of multiple leading pharmaceutical companies across key countries including Switzerland, Germany, Denmark, Italy, Singapore, the US, Israel, and India. The company's Ultra Energy series holds all eight top positions in the US Energy Star rankings for its category, making it the bestselling line in that segment. ... Looking ahead, Haier Biomedical is set to deepen its localization investments and expand its product range, with the goal of helping global biopharmaceutical and life sciences laboratories improve efficiency and sustainability, as part of the company's vision to lead the world in delivering integrated life sciences tools and intelligent productivity platforms. ... Haier Biomedical ... ### Haier Biomedical lance des produits innov ... et à faible empre ... carbone lors de deux grands salons professionnels"
HAIER,,,,Exa,Haier Kicks Off 2026 in Saudi Arabia with Dual Celebrations: Partnering for a ‘Brighter Future’ and Inviting the Public to ‘Play with the Number Ones’-Haier Saudi Arabia,www.haier.com,2026-05-28T00:00:00.000Z,2026-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.haier.com/sa/about-haier/news/20260528_291439.shtml,"Haier Kicks Off 2026 in Saudi Arabia with Dual Celebrations: Partnering for a ‘Brighter Future’ and Inviting the Public to ‘Play with the Number Ones’-Haier Saudi Arabia ... # Haier Kicks Off 2026 in Saudi Arabia with Dual Celebrations: Partnering for a ‘Brighter Future’ and Inviting the Public to ‘Play with the Number Ones’ ... Dammam/Riyadh, Saudi Arabia – January 12, 2026 – Haier, the world’s leading IoT ecosystem brand and the global No. 1 major appliance brand for 17 consecutive years, today launched two landmark initiatives in Saudi Arabia, underscoring its deep commitment to the Kingdom’s market and vision. ... Under the theme “Stronger Together, Brighter Future,” Haier hosted its Saudi Arabia Distributors Conference & 2026 Strategic Launch in Riyadh. The strategic conference gathered key distributor partners to reflect on 2025’s success and co-chart the course for 2026, reinforcing a shared mission to lead through innovation and customer-centric solutions that embody the spirit of “playing with the number ones.” ... Concurrently in Dammam, Haier inaugurated the “Play with the Number Ones” Global Premium Sports Event pop-up, a massive 1,856-square-meter experience at Corniche Square, Al Khobar, open until January 16. As the official partner of Al Hilal Saudi Football Club and Liverpool Football Club, Haier transformed cutting-edge technology into interactive football challenges. Visitors immersed themselves in appliance-powered games, explored dedicated photo zones, and stood to win exclusive club merchandise and Haier home appliance prizes. ... The event showcases Haier’s region-specific innovations designed for the Saudi climate and evolving consumer demands, particularly among younger households seeking quality living: ... On January 14, Eng. Hussein bin Manea Al-Abbas, Director of Technical Affairs at Al Khobar Municipality, visited the site on behalf of the Governor. After reviewing Haier's tailored innovations, he particularly commended the advanced air-conditioning technology, stating, ""This well-executed, engaging event aligns with our goal to enhance residents' quality of life. We look forward to deeper collaboration with Haier."" ... Mr. Jiang Liang, General Manager of Haier Saudi, emphasized the brand's commitment: ""We remain focused on building a premium brand and becoming the top choice for Saudi consumers through product leadership and superior end-to-end experience."" Haier supports this with its ""24-hour delivery and installation"" and ""2-1-0"" service standard (2-hour appointment, 1-day completion, zero complaints), while strengthening its premium image through its partnership with Al Hilal and sustained brand investment. ... The pop-up reflects the local implementation of Haier's global strategy ""Play with the Number Ones,"" integrating champion-level product innovation, strategic local partnerships, and community engagement to reinforce its role as a technology leader and lifestyle enabler. ... The event demonstrates Haier's integrated ""online-offline, B2B-B2C"" approach and strong local resource integration. Guided by Saudi Vision 2030, Haier will continue collaborating with local partners to enable smarter, higher-quality living through innovation and exceptional experiences."
