AURIGA POLYMERS,,,,Perplexity,Auriga Space Adapting Electromagnetic Launch Tech For Counter-Drone Interception,Defense Daily,2026-07-15T00:00:00Z,2026-07-15 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.defensedaily.com/auriga-space-adapting-electromagnetic-launch-tech-for-counter-drone-interception/advanced-transformational-technology/,"Auriga Space announced a three-year CRADA with the U.S. Army's DEVCOM Armaments Center to advance electromagnetic launch technology for counter-drone applications. The article frames the partnership as a technology-development effort aimed at lower-cost, higher-rate intercept options against drone swarms. For supplier and partnership risk analysis, this is relevant because it signals a shift toward defense-oriented commercialization, multi-year collaboration dependency, and potential procurement opportunity tied to government-backed R&D."
