ZETA TECHNICAL SERVICES,,,,Exa,"Morgan Stanley Adjusts Price Target on Zeta Global to $25 From $23, Maintains Equalweight Rating | MarketScreener",www.marketscreener.com (MT Newswires),2026-08-05T00:00:00.000Z,2026-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.marketscreener.com/news/morgan-stanley-adjusts-price-target-on-zeta-global-to-25-from-23-maintains-equalweight-rating-ce7f50dfdc81f622,"Morgan Stanley Adjusts Price Target on Zeta Global to $25 From $23, Maintains Equalweight Rating | MarketScreener ... | Aug. 05 | RBC Adjusts Price Target on Zeta Global to $31 From $29, Maintains Outperform Rating | MT | | --- | --- | --- | | Aug. 05 | Stray alert from NYSE tagged to multiple companies withdrawn | RE | ... # Morgan Stanley Adjusts Price Target on Zeta Global to $25 From $23, Maintains Equalweight Rating ... Published on 08/05/2026 at 05:58 am EDT ... ### Latest news about Zeta Global Holdings Corp. ... | Aug. 05 | RBC Adjusts Price Target on Zeta Global to $31 From $29, Maintains Outperform Rating | MT | | --- | --- | --- | | Aug. 05 | Stray alert from NYSE tagged to multiple companies withdrawn | RE | | Aug. 05 | B. Riley Adjusts Price Target on Zeta Global to $32 From $30, Maintains Buy Rating | MT | | Aug. 05 | Morgan Stanley Adjusts Price Target on Zeta Global to $25 From $23, Maintains Equalweight Rating | MT | | Aug. 04 | Zeta Global Holdings Corp., Q2 2026 Earnings Call, Aug 04, 2026 | | | Aug. 04 | Zeta Global Swings to Q2 Earnings, Revenue Rises; Shares Drop After Hours | MT | | Aug. 04 | (ZETA) Zeta Global Expects Full Year 2026 Revenue Range $1.81B - $1.82B, vs. FactSet Est of $1.79B | MT | | Aug. 04 | (ZETA) Zeta Global Holdings Corp. Expects Q3 Revenue Range $469.0M - $472.0M | MT | | Aug. 04 | Earnings Flash (ZETA) Zeta Global Holdings Corp. Reports Q2 Revenue $442.8M, vs. FactSet Est of $420.6M | MT | | Aug. 04 | Zeta Global Holdings Corp. Reports Earnings Results for the Second Quarter and Six Months Ended June 30, 2026 | CI | | Aug. 04 | Zeta Global Holdings Corp. Increases Earnings Guidance for the Third Quarter and Full Year 2026 | CI | | Jul. 29 | Zeta Global Announces Appointment of Trey Campbell as Senior Vice President, Investor Relations, Effective July 27, 2026 | CI | | Jul. 27 | Zeta Global Closes new $1 Billion Credit Facility | MT | | Jul. 06 | Zeta Global Holdings Corp. - Special Call | | | Jun. 23 | Zeta Global Holdings Corp. - Special Call | | ... Zeta Global Holdings Corp. is a marketing technology company that uses proprietary data, artificial intelligence (AI) and software to create a technology platform that enables marketers to acquire, retain and grow customer relationships. The Company empowers its customers to target, connect and engage consumers through software that delivers personalized marketing across all addressable channels, including email, social media, web, chat, Connected TV and video, among others. Its Generative AI (GenAI)-driven marketing solutions enable brands to personalize experiences on a scale, measure impact with precision and optimize marketing spending to increase return on investment. Its Zeta Marketing Platform (ZMP) is an AI-powered marketing platform with identity data at its core. Leveraging GenAI and machine learning, the ZMP processes billions of structured and unstructured data signals to predict consumer intent, optimize messaging and drive personalized messaging across all channels. ... Morgan Stanley Adjusts Price Target on Zeta ... to $2 ... $23, Maintains"
ZETA TECHNICAL SERVICES,,,,Exa,Why Are Zeta Global (ZETA) Shares Soaring Today - StockStory,stockstory.org,2026-08-05T00:00:00.000Z,2026-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,,https://stockstory.org/us/stocks/nyse/zeta/news/why-up-down/why-are-zeta-global-zeta-shares-soaring-today,"Shares of marketing technology company Zeta Global (NYSE:ZETA) jumped 11.9% in the afternoon session after the company reported strong second-quarter financial results that beat analyst expectations and raised its full-year guidance. ... The marketing technology firm announced total revenue of $442.8 million, a 43.5% year-over-year increase that surpassed the consensus estimate of $420.7 million. The company also reported a GAAP profit of $0.03 per share, significantly outperforming Wall Street estimates of a $0.03 per share loss. ... The growth was attributed to strong customer demand and increasing adoption of its AI-powered marketing platform. In light of the strong performance, management raised its full-year revenue forecast to $1.82 billion at the midpoint. This impressive ""beat-and-raise"" quarter signaled strong business momentum, leading investors to bid up the stock. ... Zeta Global’s shares are extremely volatile and have had 47 moves greater than 5% over the last year. But moves this big are rare even for Zeta Global and indicate this news significantly impacted the market’s perception of the business. ... The previous big move we wrote about was 2 days ago when the stock gained 3.7% on the news that the software sector caught a massive tailwind, fueled by easing geopolitical tensions and a fresh wave of AI-driven M&A. Over the weekend, President Trump abruptly called off a planned military offensive against Iran. Yielding to pressure from Gulf allies, the administration shifted toward diplomatic talks to reopen the Strait of Hormuz. This critical de-escalation relieved pressure on global energy markets and inflation expectations, accelerating a drop in Treasury yields. For software, this shifting macro backdrop is the perfect catalyst. Lower interest rates reduce the discount rate applied to expected future cash flows, driving capital back into growth-oriented tech equities. Furthermore, a lower-yield environment provides cheaper borrowing costs to fund ongoing AI development and the aggressive acquisitions currently sweeping the industry. Strategic dealmaking continues to accelerate. Yellow.ai, a global leader in enterprise agentic AI, announced a $550 million SPAC merger with Bluerock Acquisition Corp to go public under the ticker ""YAI."" Meanwhile, financial automation leader AutoRek acquired Grath to integrate its AI-driven reconciliation and compliance technology. ... Zeta Global is up 37.6% since the beginning of the year, and at $27.41 per share, it has set a new 52-week high. Investors who bought $1,000 worth of Zeta Global’s shares 5 years ago would now be looking at an investment worth $4,537."
ZETA TECHNICAL SERVICES,,,,Exa,"Zeta Global Holdings Corp. Stock 12‑Month Price Target Raised to $29.32, Implies 21% Upside — TradingView News",www.tradingview.com,2026-08-05T00:00:00.000Z,2026-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.tradingview.com/news/tradingview:770d649e40012:0-zeta-global-holdings-corp-stock-12-month-price-target-raised-to-29-32-implies-21-upside/,"Zeta Global Holdings Corp. Stock 12‑Month Price Target Raised to $29.82, Implies 23% Upside — TradingView News ... # Zeta Global Holdings Corp. Stock 12‑Month Price Target Raised to $29.82, Implies 23% Upside ... - According to estimates from 14 analysts, Zeta Global Holdings Corp. stock's average price target has risen from $28.68 to $29.82, with forecasts ranging from $25 to $44 per share - Based on the Aug. 4 closing price, the updated target implies approximately 23% potential upside - Consensus rating remains at “Buy” across 17 covering analysts, with 15 Buys, 2 Holds and 0 Sells ... Explore more price target data and ratings for Zeta Global Holdings Corp. on the Forecasts tab, and track all previous and future analyst recommendations for Zeta Global Holdings Corp. in the dedicated News Flow."
