f AI driven marketing, investors should also be aware that Zeta’s dependence on agency relationships means that if a few large holding companies change course on external platforms or accelerate in housing of their marketing technology, the impact on revenue visibility and earnings stability could be far more abrupt than headline growth figures might suggest... ... Zeta Global Holdings' narrative projects $2.5 billion revenue and $239.8 million earnings by 2029. This requires 19.7% yearly revenue growth and a $263.0 million earnings increase from -$23.2 million today. ... lowest analysts take a more cautious view, even as they still forecast revenue of about US$2. ... near US$24 ... .6 million by 2029 ... risk can look very different depending on which assumptions you find most convincing. ... Operates an omnichannel data-driven cloud platform that provides enterprises with consumer intelligence and marketing automation software in the United States and internationally."
