s. Athena for Insights and Measurement is available to agency partners in beta, with full availability scheduled to be rolled out throughout the remainder of 2026. Zeta Global will spotlight Athena by Zeta throughout Cannes Lions 2026, hosting daily demos and client engagements at the Athena suite. ... Zeta Global Holdings Corp. is a marketing technology company that uses proprietary data, artificial intelligence (AI) and software to create a technology platform that enables marketers to acquire, retain and grow customer relationships. The Company empowers its customers to target, connect and engage consumers through software that delivers personalized marketing across all addressable channels, including email, social media, web, chat, Connected TV and video, among others. Its Generative AI (GenAI)-driven marketing solutions enable brands to personalize experiences on a scale, measure impact with precision and optimize marketing spending to increase return on investment. Its Zeta Marketing Platform (ZMP) is an AI-powered marketing platform with identity data at its core. Leveraging GenAI and machine learning, the ZMP processes billions of structured and unstructured data signals to predict consumer intent, optimize messaging and drive personalized messaging across all channels. ### Ratings"
