ZETA TECHNICAL SERVICES,,,,Perplexity,Zeta Global Enters into a Strategic Partnership with Palantir Technologies,Yahoo Finance,2026-06-23T00:00:00Z,2026-06-23 00:00:00+00:00,,https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/zeta-global-zeta-enters-strategic-081829618.html,"Zeta Global formed a strategic alliance with Palantir Technologies to develop an AI infrastructure layer that integrates customer intelligence, operational intelligence, and marketing execution. The article says the partnership will help bring the combined solution to eligible Palantir Foundry customers and support Zeta's enterprise go-to-market efforts. This is important for procurement and vendor risk because it indicates deeper platform dependence on strategic technology partnerships and a broader enterprise AI commercialization push."
ZETA TECHNICAL SERVICES,,,,Perplexity,"Zeta Global Brings Athena by Zeta to Agencies, Putting Agentic AI at the Center of Every Marketing Decision",StockTitan,2026-06-19T00:00:00Z,2026-06-19 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.stocktitan.net/news/ZETA/zeta-global-brings-athena-by-zeta-tm-to-agencies-putting-agentic-ai-qwdjd61ma6v8.html,"Zeta Global expanded Athena by Zeta to agencies, positioning agentic AI at the center of marketing decision-making. The release frames Athena as a product innovation aimed at agencies and suggests broader adoption of AI-driven workflows across Zeta’s customer base. This matters for procurement planning because it signals a product roadmap focused on AI capabilities, which may change service delivery models, technology dependencies, and partner requirements."
ZETA TECHNICAL SERVICES,,,,Perplexity,Zeta Global Joins Forces with Snowflake to Spearhead Open Semantic Interchange to Establish a Universal Data Standard for AI-Powered Marketing,Yahoo Finance,2026-05-14T00:00:00Z,2026-05-14 00:00:00+00:00,,https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/zeta-global-joins-forces-snowflake-200500565.html,"Zeta Global joined Snowflake’s Open Semantic Interchange initiative to help establish a universal data standard for AI-powered marketing. The announcement implies Zeta is working to improve interoperability and standardization across data and AI ecosystems. For procurement and supplier management, this points to a company strategy centered on ecosystem integration and standards alignment, which may affect partner selection and data-governance requirements."
