CVS PHARMACY,,,,Perplexity,CVS Health reports strong second-quarter 2026 results and raises full-year guidance,CVS Health Investor Relations,2026-08-05T00:00:00Z,2026-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,,https://investors.cvshealth.com/news/news-details/2026/CVS-HEALTH-CORPORATION-REPORTS-STRONG-SECOND-QUARTER-2026-RESULTS-AND-RAISES-FULL-YEAR-2026-GUIDANCE/default.aspx,"CVS Health reported second-quarter 2026 revenue of $106.1 billion, up 7.3% year over year, and raised full-year 2026 guidance after stronger-than-expected results. The release highlights improved performance in Health Care Benefits, stronger cash flow, and a new comprehensive GLP-1 support approach across CVS Pharmacy and MinuteClinic. For procurement and supplier strategy, the key signals are continued margin recovery, higher cash generation, and CVS’s push into medication support services that can affect category demand and partner requirements."
CVS PHARMACY,,,,Perplexity,CVS raises annual profit forecast on improved drug revenues,Reuters,2026-08-05T00:00:00Z,2026-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.reuters.com/legal/litigation/cvs-raises-annual-profit-forecast-improved-drug-revenues-2026-08-05/,"Reuters reported that CVS beat second-quarter expectations and raised its 2026 earnings forecast, but investors were disappointed by the scale of the outlook increase and by preliminary 2027 guidance. The article says CVS also warned about challenges in its pharmacy benefit manager business next year. This is useful for supplier negotiations because it signals stronger near-term performance but potential pricing and margin pressure in PBM-related operations."
