CVS PHARMACY,,,,Perplexity,CVS triples net income thanks to booming health plan profitability,Healthcare Dive,2026-08-05T00:00:00Z,2026-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.healthcaredive.com/news/cvs-triples-net-income-q2-2026-raises-outlook/827041/,"Healthcare Dive reported that CVS nearly tripled net income in the second quarter, driven by a sharp improvement in Aetna profitability. The article also notes stronger operating income in health services and pharmacy and consumer wellness. For procurement planning, this points to improved corporate flexibility but also a business mix that remains exposed to insurance cost trends and pharmacy execution."
CVS PHARMACY,,,,Perplexity,CVS Q2 earnings call pairs Aetna recovery with 2027 PBM risks,Yahoo Finance,2026-08-05T00:00:00Z,2026-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,,https://finance.yahoo.com/healthcare/articles/cvs-q2-earnings-call-pairs-140000425.html,"Yahoo Finance summarized CVS management’s second-quarter earnings call, highlighting higher revenue, stronger operating cash flow guidance, and improved enterprise adjusted operating income. The summary also flags management’s caution about PBM risks in 2027. This source is relevant for negotiations because it shows CVS is strengthening financial targets while still warning about future business-model pressure in pharmacy benefit management."
