CVS PHARMACY,,,,Perplexity,CVS Health enhances direct-to-consumer weight management offerings for GLP-1 medications,PR Newswire,2026-08-05T00:00:00Z,2026-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/cvs-health-enhances-its-direct-to-consumer-weight-management-offerings-to-improve-access-affordability-care-and-support-for-glp-1-medications-302843020.html,"CVS Health announced a partnership with Eli Lilly to expand direct-to-consumer access for GLP-1 weight management therapies through the CVS Health app. The company said eligible patients will be able to view pricing and access options for Zepbound and Foundayo, with broader support across pharmacy and MinuteClinic channels. For procurement and supplier strategy, this is an important product and partnership development because it shows CVS is building a more integrated obesity-care offering that may influence demand, channel mix, and partner requirements."
CVS PHARMACY,,,,Perplexity,CVS Health expands GLP-1 services with lower costs and virtual care,Investing.com,2026-08-05T00:00:00Z,2026-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/cvs-health-expands-glp1-services-with-lower-costs-virtual-care-93CH-4752655,"Investing.com reported that CVS introduced several GLP-1 support initiatives, including a Medicare bridge program, a virtual weight management service, and expanded over-the-counter product displays for side effects management. The article also notes updates to commercial formularies that expand weight-management medication options. For procurement, this indicates CVS is reshaping demand around GLP-1 support services, OTC products, and care delivery workflows."
CVS PHARMACY,,,,Perplexity,CVS Health launches Eli Lilly GLP-1 partnership and lifts outlook as profit increases,Morningstar,2026-08-05T00:00:00Z,2026-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.morningstar.com/news/dow-jones/202608054617/cvs-health-launches-eli-lilly-glp-1-partnership-lifts-outlook-as-2q-profit-increases,"Morningstar reported that CVS will let patients use its app to view pricing options for Eli Lilly’s Zepbound and Foundayo and may offer same-day pickup at CVS pharmacies. The article says CVS is also expanding pharmacy support and lowering barriers through online visits. For procurement and supplier negotiations, this points to CVS using partnerships and digital channels to deepen category integration and improve customer access in weight management."
CVS PHARMACY,,,,Perplexity,CVS expands Salesforce partnership to enhance AI-driven call center personalization,Digital Health News,2026-08-04T00:00:00Z,2026-08-04 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.digitalhealthnews.com/cvs-expands-salesforce-partnership-to-enhance-ai-driven-call-center-personalization,"Digital Health News reported that CVS is expanding its partnership with Salesforce to use Agentforce Health across its healthcare businesses, including Aetna and Caremark. The goal is to give call center agents real-time access to member information and improve personalization and efficiency. This matters for supplier and operational risk because it indicates ongoing investment in AI-enabled service delivery and enterprise data integration."
