rcialization, and implementation services. Under its exclusive agreement with Rain Enhancement Technologies, UASIT serves as RET's exclusive representative and implementation partner in Türkiye for the evaluation and deployment of the WETA platform. UASIT aims to develop and support scientifically evaluated, controlled, and transparent pilot projects in cooperation with relevant public institutions, scientific experts, water authorities, and agricultural stakeholders, in accordance with applicable laws and institutional approvals. The company's mission is to contribute to climate adaptation, water security, drought resilience, and sustainable water-resource management through responsibly evaluated technology solutions. ... The disclosure herein ... certain statements that are ... potential expansion of the WETA Platform to other ... regions of Turkey ... the anticipated benefits ... s WETA platform and technology; ... opportunity for rain enhancement technologies and products ... as amended from time to time. If any of these risks materialize or our assumptions prove incorrect, actual results could differ materially from the results ... these forward-looking statements. The risks and uncertainties above are not exhaustive, and there may be additional risks that Rain Enhancement Technologies, Inc. (""RETI"") and RET do not presently know or that RETI and RET currently believe are immaterial that could also cause actual results to differ from those contained in ... forward-looking statements. In addition, forward-looking statements reflect RETI and RET's expectations, plans or forecasts of future events and views as of the date of this press release. RETI and RET anticipate that subsequent events and developments will cause RETI and RET's assessments to change. However, while RETI and RET Holdco may elect to update these forward-looking statements at some point in ... future, RETI and RET specifically disclaim any obligation to do so. These forward-looking statements 