GANDHAR OIL REFINERY,,,,Perplexity,Gandhar Oil Refinery (India) Limited Q4 FY26 Results,Inve.money,2026-05-27T00:00:00Z,2026-05-27 00:00:00+00:00,,https://inve.money/concalls/GANDHAR/q4-2026,"This earnings-call summary states that Gandhar Oil delivered Q4 FY26 revenue of about Rs 1,093 crore and FY26 revenue of about Rs 4,241 crore, with improved PAT and cash flow from operations. It also says the company diversified raw material sourcing away from the Middle East toward Korean and domestic suppliers such as BPCL and Indian Oil to mitigate Hormuz-related shipping and pricing risk, and that international business contributed a significant share of revenue."
GANDHAR OIL REFINERY,,,,Syracuse,Gandhar Oil posts Q1 FY27 earnings call transcript for investors,TipRanks,2026-07-28T00:00:00Z,2026-07-28 00:00:00+00:00,FinancialReportingActivity,https://www.tipranks.com/news/company-announcements/gandhar-oil-posts-q1-fy27-earnings-call-transcript-for-investors,"Gandhar Oil Refinery (India) Limited has released the official transcript of its Q1 FY 2026-27 earnings conference call with analysts and investors, covering results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026. The document, filed under SEBI's listing disclosure norms, is now available to stock exchanges and on the company's website, enhancing transparency and access to its quarterly performance discussion. The filing underscores Gandhar Oil's adherence to regulatory disclosure requirements and its intent to keep market participants informed about management's commentary on financial and operational performance. By publishing the detailed call transcript, the company enables investors and other stakeholders to review its outlook and strategic communication in a consistent, accessible format. More about Gandhar Oil Refinery (India) Limited Gandhar Oil Refinery (India) Limited operates in the oil and petroleum products sector, focusing on refined specialty oils and related formulations for industrial and consumer applications."
GANDHAR OIL REFINERY,,,,Syracuse,"Gandhar Oil Refinery Declares 100% Interim Dividend, Reshapes Board Governance",TipRanks,2026-07-22T00:00:00Z,2026-07-22 00:00:00+00:00,FinancialReportingActivity,https://www.tipranks.com/news/company-announcements/gandhar-oil-refinery-declares-100-interim-dividend-reshapes-board-governance,"Gandhar Oil Refinery (India) Limited (( IN: GANDHAR) ) just unveiled an update. Gandhar Oil Refinery (India) Limited's board has approved unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter ended 30 June 2026 and declared an interim dividend of Rs. 2 per equity share, equivalent to 100 % of the face value, with a record date set for 31 July 2026. The company also scheduled its 34th annual general meeting for 11 September 2026 via video conferencing, appointed a new non-executive independent director, reconstituted its risk management committee, and inserted an additional clause in its memorandum of association, signalling ongoing governance adjustments and strategic fine-tuning that may impact oversight and long-term corporate objectives. These board decisions underscore Gandhar Oil Refinery's intent to reward shareholders through a full-face-value interim dividend while simultaneously strengthening its governance framework."
