NECTAR 360 SERVICES,,,,Linkup,Sainsbury’s Nectar360 Unit First UK Retail Media Network To Achieve IAB Europe Certification - KamCity,KamCity,2026-06-01T00:00:00Z,2026-06-01 00:00:00+00:00,,https://www.kamcity.com/namnews/uk-and-ireland/supermarkets/sainsburys-nectar360-unit-first-uk-retail-media-network-to-achieve-iab-europe-certification/,"Nectar360, Sainsbury’s retail media, loyalty and insights business, became the first UK retailer to achieve IAB Europe’s Retail Media Certification following an independent audit by ABC. This certification supports transparent reporting and consistent campaign evaluation, reinforcing Nectar360's leadership in retail media measurement."
