GREEN BAY PACKAGING,,,,Perplexity,Green Bay Packers Report Financial Drop After Aggressive Spending,Yahoo Sports,2026-07-24T00:00:00Z,2026-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,,https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/green-bay-packers-report-financial-191705115.html,"This piece explains that the Packers moved from an $83.7 million operating profit the prior year to a $1.1 million operating loss in the latest fiscal year. It links the decline to aggressive spending and highlights that non-operating income, including investment gains and NFL media transaction effects, lifted net income to $132.5 million."
GREEN BAY PACKAGING,,,,Perplexity,Green Bay Packers’ financial loss speaks volumes about where the NFL is at right now,Yahoo Sports,2026-07-24T00:00:00Z,2026-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,,https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/green-bay-packers-financial-loss-191802378.html,"This article interprets the Packers' $1.1 million loss on $753 million in revenue as evidence of broader NFL cost pressure, especially around player compensation and roster moves. It notes the team attributed the deficit to the costs of signing Micah Parsons and other trades and cuts, while revenue still increased nearly 5% year over year."
